array (
  'pid' => '1232284',
  'post' => '<div style="margin:20px; margin-top:5px; "> <div class="smallfont" style="margin-bottom:2px">Quote:</div> <table cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="99%"> <tr> <td class="alt2" style="border:1px inset">  Originally Posted by <strong>KittenHeart</strong> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/post/1376064"><img class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" border="0" alt="View Post"></a>  <div style="font-style:italic">Yeah I got the keycard holders on Ebay and the wrist coils from Punch and Coil onlineâ€¦ I donâ€™t recommend them at all though. I received them and they ALL had rust all over the metal and DH spent hours trying to remove the rust with no success. Finally ended up buying new metal rings and replacing them all.</div> </td> </tr> </table> </div>Thanks for the heads up!<br /> <br /> <div style="margin:20px; margin-top:5px; "> <div class="smallfont" style="margin-bottom:2px">Quote:</div> <table cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="99%"> <tr> <td class="alt2" style="border:1px inset">  Originally Posted by <strong>amandamarieb</strong> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/post/1376148"><img class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" border="0" alt="View Post"></a>  <div style="font-style:italic">Ok Ladies so I need som help deciding on flowers. i thought that I send you photos of my &quot;look&quot; so you can have a good idea of what else is going on.</div> </td> </tr> </table> </div>I, too, think the one without the branches will work better with your scheme. I can\'t see your dress since I\'m at work (they block out everything!) but I wanna see it!! Lol. Everything else I\'ve seen is very pretty. I chose Mori Lee for my BMs too and I love those suits. Good taste!<br /> <br /> <div style="margin:20px; margin-top:5px; "> <div class="smallfont" style="margin-bottom:2px">Quote:</div> <table cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="99%"> <tr> <td class="alt2" style="border:1px inset">  Originally Posted by <strong>LAURERN1564</strong> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/post/1376179"><img class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" border="0" alt="View Post"></a>  <div style="font-style:italic">Hi Everyone!<br /> <br /> I am new to this so I have a lot of questions. We\'re planning on getting married @ Azul Sensatori May 25th, 2011. We are still waiting for our date to be confirmed.<br /> <br /> We will have over 15 rooms booked. Have any of you received discounts for travelers for booking so many rooms? <br /> <br /> I know that if we book at least 15 rooms we stay for free, but I feel like a discount should be offered to our families?<br /> <br /> Any insight would be helpful, I have nooooo idea what I am doing :)<br /> <br /> Thx,<br /> Lauren</div> </td> </tr> </table> </div><img src="http://files.bestdestinationwedding.com/images/smilies/welcome3.gif" border="0" alt="" title="Welcome3" class="inlineimg" />Lauren! Getting a travel agent should be the 1st thing on your agenda if you\'re looking for great rates for your guests. If you find the right TA it will definitely make this experience more manageable and he/she can give you insight on promotions and deals that can benefit you as well as your guests. I recommend you still do your homework tho and the ladies here usually post when they hear of a deal. I\'ve saved about $1500 so far.<br /> <br /> <div style="margin:20px; margin-top:5px; "> <div class="smallfont" style="margin-bottom:2px">Quote:</div> <table cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="99%"> <tr> <td class="alt2" style="border:1px inset">  Originally Posted by <strong>gems2104</strong> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/post/1376355"><img class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" border="0" alt="View Post"></a>  <div style="font-style:italic">Hi ladies<br /> This is my first post so not sure how this really works but I have booked my wedding for 19th April 2011 in the Sensatori Hotel in Mexico and cant wait. Was wondering if anyone had any good starting points as I do not know who my WC is or spoken to anyone at the hotel as I have booked through Thomson\'s TA. Any help would be gratefully received. So much to think about.<br /> Thanks<br /> Gemma</div> </td> </tr> </table> </div><img src="http://files.bestdestinationwedding.com/images/smilies/welcome.gif" border="0" alt="" title="welcome" class="inlineimg" /> Gemma! Definitely go back and read. It\'s amazing how much you didn\'t think you wanted/needed to know about the resort and the process until you read. If you\'re like me, you\'ll try shortcuts but I honestly read from page 400 on and I highly recommend it.<br /> <br /> <div style="margin:20px; margin-top:5px; "> <div class="smallfont" style="margin-bottom:2px">Quote:</div> <table cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="99%"> <tr> <td class="alt2" style="border:1px inset">  Originally Posted by <strong>strickl95</strong> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/post/1376573"><img class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" border="0" alt="View Post"></a>  <div style="font-style:italic">Has anyone used Alberto Aldana (works for Claudia Rodriguez) for their photographer?</div> </td> </tr> </table> </div>Sorry, never heard of him<br /> <br /> <div style="margin:20px; margin-top:5px; "> <div class="smallfont" style="margin-bottom:2px">Quote:</div> <table cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="99%"> <tr> <td class="alt2" style="border:1px inset">  Originally Posted by <strong>bigboponthebeach</strong> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/post/1376776"><img class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" border="0" alt="View Post"></a>  <div style="font-style:italic">I too am missing Cecile!!! I am feeling spoiled because she was sooooo responsive. But I hope she si happier wherever she has gone because I\'m sure that can become a stressful job. :-( I just hope Faye can pull her weight and dive in working! <br /> <br /> Also, talk to a TA about what they can secure for you and take the webinar so that you can to qualify for a free room upgrade.</div> </td> </tr> </table> </div>Have you heard anything from Faye? I got an email from Fabio Thursday but still haven\'t heard from Carolina...and I\'m starting to freak out. I chose to procrastinate on dealing with the stuff at the resort but now that I\'m ready to make decisions I have had no contact with anyone to actually make plans for a month!! Kinda frustrating!!<br /> <br /> I keep asking this question, but I don\'t think anyone has answered me yet. How do you hear about the webinars? Is that info from your TA or the website?',
)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
> Time: 1395962205 / Thu, 27 Mar 2014 23:16:45 +0000
> URL: /admin/index.php?adsess=845f6c850772369311b67ecf8645904c&app=forums&module=forums&section=fix&st=158250
> <div style="margin:20px; margin-top:5px; "> <div class="smallfont">Quote:</div> <table cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="99%"> <tr> <td class="alt2" style="border:1px inset">  Originally Posted by <strong>KittenHeart</strong> <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href="/forum/post/1376064"><img class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" border="0" alt="View Post"></a>  <div style="font-style:italic">Yeah I got the keycard holders on Ebay and the wrist coils from Punch and Coil onlineâ€¦ I donâ€™t recommend them at all though. I received them and they ALL had rust all over the metal and DH spent hours trying to remove the rust with no success. Finally ended up buying new metal rings and replacing them all.</div> </td> </tr> </table> </div>Thanks for the heads up!<br /> <br /> <div style="margin:20px; margin-top:5px; "> <div class="smallfont">Quote:</div> <table cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="99%"> <tr> <td class="alt2" style="border:1px inset">  Originally Posted by <strong>amandamarieb</strong> <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href="/forum/post/1376148"><img class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" border="0" alt="View Post"></a>  <div style="font-style:italic">Ok Ladies so I need som help deciding on flowers. i thought that I send you photos of my &quot;look&quot; so you can have a good idea of what else is going on.</div> </td> </tr> </table> </div>I, too, think the one without the branches will work better with your scheme. I can't see your dress since I'm at work (they block out everything!) but I wanna see it!! Lol. Everything else I've seen is very pretty. I chose Mori Lee for my BMs too and I love those suits. Good taste!<br /> <br /> <div style="margin:20px; margin-top:5px; "> <div class="smallfont">Quote:</div> <table cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="99%"> <tr> <td class="alt2" style="border:1px inset">  Originally Posted by <strong>LAURERN1564</strong> <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href="/forum/post/1376179"><img class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" border="0" alt="View Post"></a>  <div style="font-style:italic">Hi Everyone!<br /> <br /> I am new to this so I have a lot of questions. We're planning on getting married @ Azul Sensatori May 25th, 2011. We are still waiting for our date to be confirmed.<br /> <br /> We will have over 15 rooms booked. Have any of you received discounts for travelers for booking so many rooms? <br /> <br /> I know that if we book at least 15 rooms we stay for free, but I feel like a discount should be offered to our families?<br /> <br /> Any insight would be helpful, I have nooooo idea what I am doing :)<br /> <br /> Thx,<br /> Lauren</div> </td> </tr> </table> </div><img src="http://files.bestdestinationwedding.com/images/smilies/welcome3.gif" border="0" alt="" title="Welcome3" class="inlineimg" />Lauren! Getting a travel agent should be the 1st thing on your agenda if you're looking for great rates for your guests. If you find the right TA it will definitely make this experience more manageable and he/she can give you insight on promotions and deals that can benefit you as well as your guests. I recommend you still do your homework tho and the ladies here usually post when they hear of a deal. I've saved about $1500 so far.<br /> <br /> <div style="margin:20px; margin-top:5px; "> <div class="smallfont">Quote:</div> <table cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="99%"> <tr> <td class="alt2" style="border:1px inset">  Originally Posted by <strong>gems2104</strong> <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href="/forum/post/1376355"><img class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" border="0" alt="View Post"></a>  <div style="font-style:italic">Hi ladies<br /> This is my first post so not sure how this really works but I have booked my wedding for 19th April 2011 in the Sensatori Hotel in Mexico and cant wait. Was wondering if anyone had any good starting points as I do not know who my WC is or spoken to anyone at the hotel as I have booked through Thomson's TA. Any help would be gratefully received. So much to think about.<br /> Thanks<br /> Gemma</div> </td> </tr> </table> </div><img src="http://files.bestdestinationwedding.com/images/smilies/welcome.gif" border="0" alt="" title="welcome" class="inlineimg" /> Gemma! Definitely go back and read. It's amazing how much you didn't think you wanted/needed to know about the resort and the process until you read. If you're like me, you'll try shortcuts but I honestly read from page 400 on and I highly recommend it.<br /> <br /> <div style="margin:20px; margin-top:5px; "> <div class="smallfont">Quote:</div> <table cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="99%"> <tr> <td class="alt2" style="border:1px inset">  Originally Posted by <strong>strickl95</strong> <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href="/forum/post/1376573"><img class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" border="0" alt="View Post"></a>  <div style="font-style:italic">Has anyone used Alberto Aldana (works for Claudia Rodriguez) for their photographer?</div> </td> </tr> </table> </div>Sorry, never heard of him<br /> <br /> <div style="margin:20px; margin-top:5px; "> <div class="smallfont">Quote:</div> <table cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="99%"> <tr> <td class="alt2" style="border:1px inset">  Originally Posted by <strong>bigboponthebeach</strong> <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href="/forum/post/1376776"><img class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" border="0" alt="View Post"></a>  <div style="font-style:italic">I too am missing Cecile!!! I am feeling spoiled because she was sooooo responsive. But I hope she si happier wherever she has gone because I'm sure that can become a stressful job. :-( I just hope Faye can pull her weight and dive in working! <br /> <br /> Also, talk to a TA about what they can secure for you and take the webinar so that you can to qualify for a free room upgrade.</div> </td> </tr> </table> </div>Have you heard anything from Faye? I got an email from Fabio Thursday but still haven't heard from Carolina...and I'm starting to freak out. I chose to procrastinate on dealing with the stuff at the resort but now that I'm ready to make decisions I have had no contact with anyone to actually make plans for a month!! Kinda frustrating!!<br /> <br /> I keep asking this question, but I don't think anyone has answered me yet. How do you hear about the webinars? Is that info from your TA or the website?
