array (
  'pid' => '1232300',
  'post' => '<div style="margin:20px; margin-top:5px; "> <div class="smallfont" style="margin-bottom:2px">Quote:</div> <table cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="99%"> <tr> <td class="alt2" style="border:1px inset">  Originally Posted by <strong>kingshead</strong> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/post/1376685"><img class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" border="0" alt="View Post"></a>  <div style="font-style:italic">Personally I love the turtle...although all are great! Here\'s my first attempt at our logo. Not sure yet though. RK</div> </td> </tr> </table> </div>I really like this - love the colour around the outside.<br /> <br /> After playing around with a few ideas I have decided to keep it simple and have gone with this one: <br /> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="http://&#91;IMG]http://i1011.photobucket.com/albums/af236/josietoms/Weddinglogo.jpg&#91;/IMG]"><a href="http://i1011.photobucket.com/albums/af236/josietoms/Weddinglogo.jpg" rel="lytebox[posts]"><img src="http://i1011.photobucket.com/albums/af236/josietoms/Weddinglogo.jpg" border="0" alt="Click the image to open in full size." class="tcattdimgresizer" /></a></a>',
