  'pid' => '1232362',
  'post' => '<div style="margin:20px; margin-top:5px; "> <div class="smallfont" style="margin-bottom:2px">Quote:</div> <table cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="99%"> <tr> <td class="alt2" style="border:1px inset">  Originally Posted by <strong>chong</strong> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/post/1376668"><img class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" border="0" alt="View Post"></a>  <div style="font-style:italic">Haha. No worries... I think we all are little bit of control freak as the date gets closer.<br /> <br /> I also ordered embroidered towels from cotton-fruit! I LOVE my towels. I folded and put a big bow around it. It\'s so cute! I would love to see your towels!!!<br /> <br /> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="http://i916.photobucket.com/albums/ad5/msdrpepper/Towels.jpg"><img src="http://i916.photobucket.com/albums/ad5/msdrpepper/Towels.jpg" border="0" alt="Click the image to open in full size." class="tcattdimgresizer" /></a></div> </td> </tr> </table> </div>I would love to post them but I\'m not that computer savy! Today the forum is going down for the upgrade, I think I read there will be a picture feature. I figure it out when it back up. I love your little chili pepper. We used our monogram.',
)
