array (
  'pid' => '1232436',
  'post' => '<div style="margin:20px; margin-top:5px; "> <div class="smallfont" style="margin-bottom:2px">Quote:</div> <table cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="99%"> <tr> <td class="alt2" style="border:1px inset">  Originally Posted by <strong>lauren</strong> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/post/1376737"><img class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" border="0" alt="View Post"></a>  <div style="font-style:italic">I\'m not friends with any if them on fb. Out of my ~120 friends, I\'d say more than half are from here...and another 20 family... I\'m telling you - I hate people!</div> </td> </tr> </table> </div>A lot of my friends are from here too...people do suck.<br /> <br /> <div style="margin:20px; margin-top:5px; "> <div class="smallfont" style="margin-bottom:2px">Quote:</div> <table cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="99%"> <tr> <td class="alt2" style="border:1px inset">  Originally Posted by <strong>-Kate-</strong> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/post/1376772"><img class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" border="0" alt="View Post"></a>  <div style="font-style:italic">What a mess. Does she realize that other people can read her FB page? I\'m so embarrassed for her.</div> </td> </tr> </table> </div>Ha! Seriously!!! It\'s a window into her mental disorder, why would she want people to see that?!<br /> <br /> Here is the latest gem...I give up.<br /> <br /> <i>Just a few more steal bricks, carefully, welded into place &amp; my heart will be impenetrable. Just the way I like it.</i><br /> <br /> <div style="margin:20px; margin-top:5px; "> <div class="smallfont" style="margin-bottom:2px">Quote:</div> <table cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="99%"> <tr> <td class="alt2" style="border:1px inset">  Originally Posted by <strong>Abbie</strong> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/post/1376838"><img class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" border="0" alt="View Post"></a>  <div style="font-style:italic">i have a &quot;friend&quot; like that too, BUT she is 16 so duhr. thats kinda what being 16 is all about! id wager jamy\'s friend is a tad older (doubleit?)</div> </td> </tr> </table> </div>Um yeah, try nearly 40!',
)
