> 
array (
  'pid' => '1234207',
  'post' => '<p> <br /> &nbsp;</p> <blockquote class="ipsBlockquote">Originally Posted by <strong>mexico102</strong>&nbsp;<a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/thread/47503/october-2010-brides/360#post_1376869"><img alt="View Post" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" style="border: 0px solid ;" /></a><br /> <br /> <div style="margin: 5px 20px 20px;"> <div class="smallfont" style="margin-bottom: 2px;"> Quote:</div> <table border="0" cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" width="99%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="alt2" style="border: 1px inset ;">  Originally Posted by <strong>chong</strong> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/post/1376668"><img alt="View Post" border="0" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" /></a> <div style="font-style: italic;"> Haha. No worries... I think we all are little bit of control freak as the date gets closer.<br /> <br /> I also ordered embroidered towels from cotton-fruit! I LOVE my towels. I folded and put a big bow around it. It&#39;s so cute! I would love to see your towels!!!<br /> <br /> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="http://i916.photobucket.com/albums/ad5/msdrpepper/Towels.jpg"><img alt="Click the image to open in full size." border="0" class="tcattdimgresizer" src="http://i916.photobucket.com/albums/ad5/msdrpepper/Towels.jpg" /></a></div> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> I would love to post them but I&#39;m not that computer savy! Today the forum is going down for the upgrade, I think I read there will be a picture feature. I figure it out when it back up. I love your little chili pepper. We used our monogram.</blockquote> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <blockquote class="ipsBlockquote">Originally Posted by <strong>wendyjd</strong>&nbsp;<a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/thread/47503/october-2010-brides/360#post_1378390"><img alt="View Post" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" style="border: 0px solid ;" /></a><br /> <br /> <p> Chong, love the towels.&nbsp; they look amazing.&nbsp;</p> <p> &nbsp;</p> <p> <strong>knacarato</strong>&nbsp;--mission control, thats great.&nbsp; our spare bedroom is full of bags/boxes everything for the wedding... hope no one plans to stay with us before then!!</p> </blockquote> <p> <br /> Thanks! We are very excited about our towels.</p>',
)
