array (
  'pid' => '1234242',
  'post' => '<p> <br /> Hi Lisa,</p> <p> &nbsp;</p> <p> Do you mind if I email you directly? My email is <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="mailto:ireland.michelle@gmail.com">ireland.michelle@gmail.com</a> I have a few questions and I&#39;d really appreciate it. Thanks!<br /> &nbsp;</p> <blockquote class="ipsBlockquote">Originally Posted by <strong>lisadias</strong>&nbsp;<a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/thread/57821/the-now-riviera-cancun/210#post_1376723"><img alt="View Post" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" style="border-right: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-bottom: 0px solid" /></a><br /> <br /> <div style="margin: 5px 20px 20px"> <div class="smallfont" style="margin-bottom: 2px"> Quote:</div> <table border="0" cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" width="99%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="alt2" style="border-right: 1px inset; border-top: 1px inset; border-left: 1px inset; border-bottom: 1px inset">  Originally Posted by <strong>MPopp</strong> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/post/1376621"><img alt="View Post" border="0" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" /></a> <div style="font-style: italic"> Thanks for the info Lisa! I called Pilar today and mentioned this and she said she is going to look into it and get back to me. I am hoping she has the same response you have gotten or I will be extremely upset! Crazy how they give such different responses from the same resort.</div> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> Pillar was only doing this as a replacement for Sandra on mat leave so maybe she is not aware of what she can do. Let me know the results!</blockquote> <br /> <br />',
)
