array (
  'pid' => '1234271',
  'post' => '<div style="margin: 5px 20px 20px"> <div class="smallfont" style="margin-bottom: 2px"> Quote:</div> <table border="0" cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" width="99%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="alt2" style="border-right: 1px inset; border-top: 1px inset; border-left: 1px inset; border-bottom: 1px inset">  Originally Posted by&nbsp;<strong>lisadias</strong> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="http://www.bestdestinationwedding.com/forum/post/1376621"><img alt="View Post" class="inlineimg" src="http://www.bestdestinationwedding.com/img/forum/go_quote.gif" style="border-right: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-bottom: 0px solid" /></a> <div style="font-style: italic"> Pillar was only doing this as a replacement for Sandra on mat leave so maybe she is not aware of what she can do. Let me know the results!</div> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> <p> Hi Lisa- Pilar&nbsp;asked me today if she could have your name, name of the groom,&nbsp;and date of the wedding so she can pull&nbsp;your file and check to see if it was some sort of promotion.&nbsp;I think it is bs, but she said if she can reference your&nbsp;account maybe she will be able to do the same for us. I told her to just talk to Sandra as she is the one you are working with but she kept going on about it may have been a promotion or&nbsp;different&nbsp;vendor they were working with. Would you mind sharing this info with me?&nbsp;My email is <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="mailto:ireland.michelle@gmail.com">ireland.michelle@gmail.com</a>. I would greatly appreciate it!</p>',
)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
> Time: 1395962205 / Thu, 27 Mar 2014 23:16:45 +0000
> URL: /admin/index.php?adsess=845f6c850772369311b67ecf8645904c&app=forums&module=forums&section=fix&st=158250
> <div style="margin: 5px 20px 20px"> <div class="smallfont"> Quote:</div> <table border="0" cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" width="99%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="alt2" style="border-right: 1px inset; border-top: 1px inset; border-left: 1px inset; border-bottom: 1px inset">  Originally Posted by&nbsp;<strong>lisadias</strong> <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href="http://www.bestdestinationwedding.com/forum/post/1376621"><img alt="View Post" class="inlineimg" src="http://www.bestdestinationwedding.com/img/forum/go_quote.gif" style="border-right: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-bottom: 0px solid" /></a> <div style="font-style: italic"> Pillar was only doing this as a replacement for Sandra on mat leave so maybe she is not aware of what she can do. Let me know the results!</div> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> <p> Hi Lisa- Pilar&nbsp;asked me today if she could have your name, name of the groom,&nbsp;and date of the wedding so she can pull&nbsp;your file and check to see if it was some sort of promotion.&nbsp;I think it is bs, but she said if she can reference your&nbsp;account maybe she will be able to do the same for us. I told her to just talk to Sandra as she is the one you are working with but she kept going on about it may have been a promotion or&nbsp;different&nbsp;vendor they were working with. Would you mind sharing this info with me?&nbsp;My email is <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href="mailto:ireland.michelle@gmail.com">ireland.michelle@gmail.com</a>. I would greatly appreciate it!</p>
