array (
  'pid' => '1234886',
  'post' => '<br /> <br /> <blockquote class="ipsBlockquote">Originally Posted by <strong>Jessica</strong>&nbsp;<a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/thread/47605/how-did-you-pick-your-baby-s-name/750#post_1356397"><img alt="View Post" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" style="border-right: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-bottom: 0px solid" /></a><br /> <br /> <div style="margin: 5px 20px 20px"> <div class="smallfont" style="margin-bottom: 2px"> Quote:</div> <table border="0" cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" width="99%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="alt2" style="border-right: 1px inset; border-top: 1px inset; border-left: 1px inset; border-bottom: 1px inset">  Originally Posted by <strong>lauren</strong> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/post/1356153"><img alt="View Post" border="0" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" /></a> <div style="font-style: italic"> i thought sloane from entourage too! i like both lyla and sloan! i mentioned lila to keith, but he nixxed it.<br /> <br /> i&#39;m keeping ryan on the back burner too, ladies. i LOVE the name for a boy, but k is now stuck on dorian...which i like, but then i realized that his mom would think that we&#39;re naming after her and i don&#39;t like it as much as i did before i realized that....<strong>anyway, k doesn&#39;t really like ryan, so i&#39;m just going to nonchalantly bring it up each time he brings up names</strong>.</div> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> That&#39;s what I&#39;m doing with the name Callum. <strong>Well that and everytime Brian sleeps I whisper the name into his ears.</strong></blockquote> <p> <br /> LOL. Awesome Jessica.</p> <p> <br /> &nbsp;</p>',
)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
