array (
  'pid' => '1235251',
  'post' => '<br /> <br /> <blockquote class="ipsBlockquote">Originally Posted by <strong>AnnR</strong>&nbsp;<a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/thread/61960/lizz-s-ttc-thread-baby-2#post_1374495"><img alt="View Post" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" style="border-right: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-bottom: 0px solid" /></a><br /> <br /> <div style="margin: 5px 20px 20px"> <div class="smallfont" style="margin-bottom: 2px"> Quote:</div> <table border="0" cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" width="99%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="alt2" style="border-right: 1px inset; border-top: 1px inset; border-left: 1px inset; border-bottom: 1px inset">  Originally Posted by <strong>Lizz</strong> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/post/1374472"><img alt="View Post" border="0" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" /></a> <div style="font-style: italic"> I know we won&#39;t be that blessed again but I&#39;m hoping it happens within the next few months.</div> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> You DON&#39;T know that, it could happen, so be prepared! lol</blockquote> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <blockquote class="ipsBlockquote">Originally Posted by <strong>Lizz</strong>&nbsp;<a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/thread/61960/lizz-s-ttc-thread-baby-2/20#post_1379752"><img alt="View Post" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" style="border-right: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-bottom: 0px solid" /></a><br /> <br /> Ummm...so I just got a BFP! I was expecting my period early this week and it didn&#39;t come and my boobs have been sore (which was my only sign with Drew) so I decided to take a cheapo dollar store test a few minutes ago and it came up positive right away. I&#39;m in shock. I know I want this but I&#39;m freaking out and more than a little scared. I looked at Drew and just started crying because i&#39;m sad our days of him being an only child are going to end. But I&#39;m happy too. Mike is at work and I want to tell him so bad but am trying to wait for him to get home. Eek!!! Fx for this little baby to stick!</blockquote> <p> <br /> <br /> Ummmmmm ... I TOLD YOU SO!&nbsp;&nbsp; lol&nbsp; Sorry, had to be done.</p> <p> &nbsp;</p> <p> CONGRATS!&nbsp; I am so excited for you!</p>',
)
