I want to tell him so bad but am trying to wait for him to get home. Eek!!! Fx for this little baby to stick!</blockquote> <p> <br /> <br /> Ummmmmm ... I TOLD YOU SO!&nbsp;&nbsp; lol&nbsp; Sorry, had to be done.</p> <p> &nbsp;</p> <p> CONGRATS!&nbsp; I am so excited for you!</p>
