array (
  'pid' => '1235564',
  'post' => '<br /> <br /> <blockquote class="ipsBlockquote">Originally Posted by <strong>JesseLyn10</strong>&nbsp;<a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/thread/38128/canadian-oot-bag-info-where-to-shop/570#post_1355654"><img alt="View Post" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" style="border-right: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-bottom: 0px solid" /></a><br /> <br /> <div style="margin: 5px 20px 20px"> <div class="smallfont" style="margin-bottom: 2px"> Quote:</div> <table border="0" cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" width="99%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="alt2" style="border-right: 1px inset; border-top: 1px inset; border-left: 1px inset; border-bottom: 1px inset">  Originally Posted by <strong>Ms.H</strong> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/post/1351560"><img alt="View Post" border="0" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" /></a> <div style="font-style: italic"> Hey Ladies,<br /> <br /> I&#39;m just curious if anyone has found great beach totes for cheap? I was at dollarama yesterday and found some that were ok, but I see the bags the girls are getting at target (straw and super cute) and just wondering if anyone has found something similar here. I&#39;m in the gta, willing to go just about anywhere for a good deal and great bag.</div> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> There&#39;s a store in Toronto called Creative Bag that I bought bags from. They have all kinds of bags and will print logos on!<br /> <br /> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="http://www.creativebag.com/">http://www.creativebag.com/</a><br /> <br /> Good luck!</blockquote> <p> &nbsp;</p> <p> Thank you so much for this JesseLyn!!! I&#39;ve been wanting plain cotton totes to iron on my own logo to!&nbsp; The price is right here! :)<br /> <br /> &nbsp;</p>',
)
