array (
  'pid' => '1237055',
  'post' => '<p> <br /> <br /> &nbsp;</p> <blockquote class="ipsBlockquote">Originally Posted by <strong>Anna22</strong>&nbsp;<a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/thread/19677/starfish-passing-thread/770#post_1375313"><img alt="View Post" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" style="border-right: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-bottom: 0px solid" /></a><br /> <br /> <div style="margin: 5px 20px 20px"> <div class="smallfont" style="margin-bottom: 2px"> Quote:</div> <table border="0" cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" width="99%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="alt2" style="border-right: 1px inset; border-top: 1px inset; border-left: 1px inset; border-bottom: 1px inset">  Originally Posted by <strong>mexico102</strong> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/post/1374263"><img alt="View Post" border="0" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" /></a> <div style="font-style: italic"> Oh no I&#39;m so sad (and mad!). I was so looking forward to the whole experience, not just using the starfish but reading and writing in the journal!! Hopefully Jenn realizes she still has it and contacts someone.</div> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> <br /> Hey guys! I just got my blue starfish - I&#39;d be happy to filter mine around to everyone on this list except<br /> <br /> 12. peterpanpixiedust - Dreams Cancun - June 14? - 26, 2011<br /> <br /> and that&#39;s only because I&#39;ll need him for my wedding on June 25, 2011.<br /> <br /> Please let me know if you ladies want to proceed with this and I&#39;ll ship him to the first bride on the list!<br /> <br /> Best wishes,<br /> Anna Scherillo</blockquote> <p> <br /> Itsfinallyhere- I&#39;m so sorry that someone lost your little guy! Anna THANK YOU for offering to pass yours around.&nbsp; I cant believe how great the girls on here are! I would love to be added to your list.&nbsp; My wedding is November 6th, I leave November 3rd. Its in Siesta Key FL and I would be able to mail him/her (which is it?&nbsp;<img alt="" height="16" src="http://files.bestdestinationwedding.com/images/smilies/rolleyes.gif" title="" width="16" /> ) from FL to the next bride.&nbsp;</p> <p> &nbsp;</p> <p> We can try to switch itsfinallyhere list to Annas- I can message the other brides on the list in case they havent heard the news!<br /> &nbsp;</p>',
)
