array (
  'pid' => '1237752',
  'post' => '<br /> <br /> <blockquote class="ipsBlockquote">Originally Posted by <strong>chicklet</strong>&nbsp;<a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/thread/60677/riu-ocho-rios-help#post_1356623"><img alt="View Post" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" style="border: 0px solid;" /></a><br /> <br /> <div style="margin: 5px 20px 20px;"> <div class="smallfont" style="margin-bottom: 2px;"> Quote:</div> <table border="0" cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" width="99%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="alt2" style="border: 1px inset;">  Originally Posted by <strong>JesseLyn10</strong> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/post/1341788"><img alt="View Post" border="0" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" /></a> <div style="font-style: italic;"> I wish I knew that before I mailed everything!<br /> <br /> I wonder what happens if they don&#39;t receive our documents. I am super nervous about this.</div> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> Bring them along with you and check when you have your appointment with the wedding co-ordinator.<br /> Everything for us went super smooth and I was worrying for nothing. Try and relax and enjoy your day! It is what it is :)</blockquote> <p> I did bring all my docs with me and although they did receive the mailed copies, the WC still took the copies I brought.</p> <p> &nbsp;</p> <p> You were SO right about the day running smoothly!&nbsp; Everything was perfect!<br /> &nbsp;</p>',
)
