 back by the end of the night. She had pricing and packages worked out same day also.<br /> <br /> As I&#39;m writing this..I just got an email from her with information for a resort I might want to switch to for honeymoon week..I asked for this late last night.<br /> <br /> &lt;text removed: against rules&gt;</blockquote> <p> <br /> <br /> msmarmar123 - Would you mid telling me the name of your TA with destinationweddings.com?&nbsp; I am also&nbsp;located in MI :)</p>
