array (
  'pid' => '1240923',
  'post' => '<div class="post-user-avatar"> Samnicolerangel - sorry for the delayed response, I am in the middle of moving so have put the wedding planning on a slight hold!!!</div> <div class="post-user-avatar"> &nbsp;</div> <div class="post-user-avatar"> I don&#39;t have the new wedding co-ordinator&#39;s email from PP - I am still waiting on a reponse as Gilberto quit</div> <div class="post-user-avatar"> &nbsp;</div> <div class="post-user-avatar"> As for the church - here is Carmita&#39;s email, she is the secretary - super sweet but only speaks spanish - <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="mailto:igdelcarmen@gmail.com"><font color="#0068cf">igdelcarmen@gmail.com</font></a></div> <div class="post-user-avatar"> &nbsp;</div> <div class="post-user-avatar"> let me know if you have any other questions<br /> &nbsp;</div> <p> <br /> <br /> &nbsp;</p> <blockquote class="ipsBlockquote">Originally Posted by <strong>samnicolerangel</strong>&nbsp;<a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/thread/59500/playacar-palace-resort-wedding-terrace-photos#post_1338046"><img alt="View Post" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" style="border-bottom: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-right: 0px solid" /></a><br /> <br /> <div style="margin: 5px 20px 20px"> <div class="smallfont" style="margin-bottom: 2px"> Quote:</div> <table border="0" cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" width="99%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="alt2" style="border-bottom: 1px inset; border-left: 1px inset; border-top: 1px inset; border-right: 1px inset">  Originally Posted by <strong>CamilleA</strong> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/post/1306918"><img alt="View Post" border="0" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" /></a> <div style="font-style: italic"> Hi Ladies<br /> <br /> We are getting married in PDC in Nov and all my guests are staying at PP - we are having the cocktail party there in between the church and reception if you give me your email address I can send you pics...yes you can get married on the beach<br /> <br /> The resort is absolutely stunning we just went down this past weekend to do wedding planning and I was soooo happy about the choice of this resort it is so calming and beauitful!! I know that they are extremely busy right now with other weddings going on so that&#39;s probably why they haven&#39;t gotten back to you - try emailing again or contact the head office</div> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> Camille,<br /> <br /> Do you have the wedding coordinators direct e-mail? Also, are you working with a wedding coordinator to organize your ceremony at the church. I don&#39;t know where to start...I am set on having a catholic ceremony...and that is mainly why we are leaning more towards being married in Playa Del Carmen. Any help would be appreciated! Thanks!!!</blockquote> <br /> <br />',
)
