each<br /> <br /> The resort is absolutely stunning we just went down this past weekend to do wedding planning and I was soooo happy about the choice of this resort it is so calming and beauitful!! I know that they are extremely busy right now with other weddings going on so that&#39;s probably why they haven&#39;t gotten back to you - try emailing again or contact the head office</div> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> Camille,<br /> <br /> Do you have the wedding coordinators direct e-mail? Also, are you working with a wedding coordinator to organize your ceremony at the church. I don&#39;t know where to start...I am set on having a catholic ceremony...and that is mainly why we are leaning more towards being married in Playa Del Carmen. Any help would be appreciated! Thanks!!!</blockquote> <br /> <br />
