array (
  'pid' => '1241072',
  'post' => '<p> <br /> <br /> I was able to find mine at one of David&#39;s Bridal&#39;s $99 gown sale. So if you have time to wait around for the next big sale, which they have so frequently, you might be able to find a great deal, I definitely did!</p> <blockquote class="ipsBlockquote">Originally Posted by <strong>andim</strong>&nbsp;<a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/thread/41334/ttd-trash-the-dress-thread-please-post-all-of-your-questions-here/400#post_1265548"><img alt="View Post" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" style="border-bottom: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-right: 0px solid" /></a><br /> <br /> <div style="margin: 5px 20px 20px"> <div class="smallfont" style="margin-bottom: 2px"> Quote:</div> <table border="0" cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" width="99%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="alt2" style="border-bottom: 1px inset; border-left: 1px inset; border-top: 1px inset; border-right: 1px inset">  Originally Posted by <strong>reaganlane</strong> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/post/1258806"><img alt="View Post" border="0" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" /></a> <div style="font-style: italic"> Ok, so random question about ttd sessions...do u wear light makeup and just waterproof eyeliner and mascara? Or no makeup at all? I could just see all my TTD pics coming out with racoon eyes and runny makeup. Brides who have done ttd...what did you wear for makeup?</div> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> This is a good question, I was wondering this as well!<br /> <br /> Another question, I&#39;m not sure if this is right thread or not, but where is a good place to buy a second dress to trash? I just wanted a white strapless dress but I&#39;m having a hard time finding one for around $100. Thoughts?</blockquote> <br /> <br />',
)
