array (
  'pid' => '1241692',
  'post' => '<p> I am also getting married on 10.10.10 at 10AM and at first my TA told me it wasn&#39;t possible but then I asked her to see what she could do, she went back and tried&nbsp;a few times and finally found a judge who would perform the ceremony.<br /> <br /> &nbsp;</p> <blockquote class="ipsBlockquote">Originally Posted by <strong>Mrs Price 2010</strong>&nbsp;<a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/thread/54832/sunday-wedding#post_1370508"><img alt="View Post" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" style="border-right: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-bottom: 0px solid" /></a><br /> <br /> <div style="margin: 5px 20px 20px"> <div class="smallfont" style="margin-bottom: 2px"> Quote:</div> <table border="0" cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" width="99%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="alt2" style="border-right: 1px inset; border-top: 1px inset; border-left: 1px inset; border-bottom: 1px inset">  Originally Posted by <strong>YrishCathe</strong> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/post/1369696"><img alt="View Post" border="0" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" /></a> <div style="font-style: italic"> I&#39;m getting married on a SUnday! 10-10-10to be exact. But I&#39;m having a religious Catholic ceremony and we&#39;re doing a private beach club for a reception and not a resort.</div> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> <br /> Ohhh I really wanted 10-10-10 as well, but was also told that they do not carry out weddings on a Sunday! 10-05-10 doesn&#39;t really have the same ring!</blockquote> <br /> <br />',
)
