array (
  'pid' => '1242082',
  'post' => '<br /> <br /> <blockquote class="ipsBlockquote">Originally Posted by <strong>Dianita11</strong>&nbsp;<a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/thread/45750/edmonton-bride/30#post_899191"><img alt="View Post" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" style="border-right: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-bottom: 0px solid" /></a><br /> <br /> <div style="margin: 5px 20px 20px"> <div class="smallfont" style="margin-bottom: 2px"> Quote:</div> <table border="0" cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" width="99%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="alt2" style="border-right: 1px inset; border-top: 1px inset; border-left: 1px inset; border-bottom: 1px inset">  Originally Posted by <strong>msemi305</strong> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/post/895267"><img alt="View Post" border="0" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" /></a> <div style="font-style: italic"> We are getting married at the Riu Bachata in Puerto Plata....Have you made any decisions yet?</div> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> Not really, just trying to narrow it down to 3 hotels.. so far i like Dreams, Majestic Colonial and Palladium.. i am still loking, i still have to look for an afordable hotel.. hehe hehe..</blockquote> <p> ITS SO HARD choosing a resort, that was the toughest part for me.&nbsp; I had to make sure it wasn&#39;t too expensive so relatives could come but I didnt&#39; want to go to a crap resort.... its a relief once you finally pick and have paid your deposit!<br /> <br /> &nbsp;</p>',
)
