array (
  'pid' => '1242182',
  'post' => '<p> <br /> Wow! I&#39;m so glad I saw this! Thank you! I am definitely confident in the videographer now!</p> <blockquote class="ipsBlockquote">Originally Posted by <strong>lisadias</strong>&nbsp;<a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/thread/57821/the-now-riviera-cancun/180#post_1373539"><img alt="View Post" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" style="border: 0px solid;" /></a><br /> <br /> <div style="margin:20px; margin-top:5px; "> <div class="smallfont" style="margin-bottom:2px"> Quote:</div> <table border="0" cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" width="99%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="alt2" style="border:1px inset">  Originally Posted by <strong>FutureMrsHolt</strong> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/post/1373156"><img alt="View Post" border="0" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" /></a> <div style="font-style:italic"> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="http://www.positive.com.mx">Fot&oacute;grafos especializados bodas sesiones books | Positive Photo Studio</a><br /> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="http://www.rivieramayaphotography.com">POSITIVE Photo Studio</a><br /> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="http://www.positiveweddings.com">POSITIVE Photo Studio</a><br /> <br /> <br /> Here is the websites for the photographer. Plus if you click on positiveweddings.com you can see weddings at the NOW!!!! Makes me even more excited.</div> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> Hi Christa<br /> <br /> I think i saw previously that you posted your reception was going to be in the yellow/blue room now called the bamboo room. Check out this video from the videographer with the resort. i like his work. i think i am going to stay with using him.<br /> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="http://www.oscarvideo.com.mx">Oscarvideo | Video - Fotografia - Cancun - Riviera Maya</a></blockquote> <br /> <br />',
)
