array (
  'pid' => '1244408',
  'post' => '<p> Norma -</p> <p> I actuall was just contacted recently by Ana Perez saying she was my new WC. I think Rebekah went to Mexico for the move, but wasn&#39;t staying too long through it. Hopefully someone has contacted you also!<br /> <br /> &nbsp;</p> <blockquote class="ipsBlockquote">Originally Posted by <strong>Norma83</strong>&nbsp;<a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/thread/58889/gran-caribe-real-2011-brides/60#post_1359523"><img alt="View Post" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" style="border-right: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-bottom: 0px solid" /></a><br /> <br /> <div style="margin: 5px 20px 20px"> <div class="smallfont" style="margin-bottom: 2px"> Quote:</div> <table border="0" cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" width="99%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="alt2" style="border-right: 1px inset; border-top: 1px inset; border-left: 1px inset; border-bottom: 1px inset">  Originally Posted by <strong>nadennec</strong> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/post/1359489"><img alt="View Post" border="0" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" /></a> <div style="font-style: italic"> I&#39;m also getting married on 11/11/11 in the chapel, doing private beach reception at night. I had no idea they moved the US offices, I havent been contacted in a while. If I want to find out who my new WC is, who should I contact to find that out? I want to make sure everything is in place with what I had with my previous WC Rebekah.<br /> Any advise?</div> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> Hi Nadenne -<br /> <br /> My coordinator is Rebekah also. As far as I know, she told me that she was still going to be my coordinator. I was also wondering if I was going to get a new coordinator so I called her to see what the deal was and she assured me that she was still going with the company. I last spoke to her about 3 weeks ago or so. I also asked her what would happen if she left the company and she said that I would be notified and that I would be assigned a new coordinator.<br /> <br /> If you aren&#39;t sure you might call her at the 800 number. It&#39;ll be easier than sending her an email. Hope this helps!<br /> <br /> -Norma</blockquote> <br /> <br />',
)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
> Time: 1395962205 / Thu, 27 Mar 2014 23:16:45 +0000
> URL: /admin/index.php?adsess=845f6c850772369311b67ecf8645904c&app=forums&module=forums&section=fix&st=158250
> <p> Norma -</p> <p> I actuall was just contacted recently by Ana Perez saying she was my new WC. I think Rebekah went to Mexico for the move, but wasn&#39;t staying too long through it. Hopefully someone has contacted you also!<br /> <br /> &nbsp;</p> <blockquote class="ipsBlockquote">Originally Posted by <strong>Norma83</strong>&nbsp;<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href="/forum/thread/58889/gran-caribe-real-2011-brides/60#post_1359523"><img alt="View Post" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" style="border-right: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-bottom: 0px solid" /></a><br /> <br /> <div style="margin: 5px 20px 20px"> <div class="smallfont"> Quote:</div> <table border="0" cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" width="99%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="alt2" style="border-right: 1px inset; border-top: 1px inset; border-left: 1px inset; border-bottom: 1px inset">  Originally Posted by <strong>nadennec</strong> <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href="/forum/post/1359489"><img alt="View Post" border="0" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" /></a> <div style="font-style: italic"> I&#39;m also getting married on 11/11/11 in the chapel, doing private beach reception at night. I had no idea they moved the US offices, I havent been contacted in a while. If I want to find out who my new WC is, who should I contact to find that out? I want to make sure everything is in place with what I had with my previous WC Rebekah.<br /> Any advise?</div> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> Hi Nadenne -<br /> <br /> My coordinator is Rebekah also. As far as I know, she told me that she was still going to be my coordinator. I was also wondering if I was going to get a new coordinator so I called her to see what the deal was and she assured me that she was still going with the company. I last spoke to her about 3 weeks ago or so. I also asked her what would happen if she left the company and she said that I would be notified and that I would be assigned a new coordinator.<br /> <br /> If you aren&#39;t sure you might call her at the 800 number. It&#39;ll be easier than sending her an email. Hope this helps!<br /> <br /> -Norma</blockquote> <br /> <br />
