array (
  'pid' => '1244623',
  'post' => '<br /> <br /> <blockquote class="ipsBlockquote">Originally Posted by <strong>rach2011</strong>&nbsp;<a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/thread/47576/dreams-riviera-cancun-brides-post-here-new-thread/3910#post_1376271"><img alt="View Post" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" style="border: 0px solid ;" /></a><br /> <br /> <div style="margin: 5px 20px 20px;"> <div class="smallfont" style="margin-bottom: 2px;"> Quote:</div> <table border="0" cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" width="99%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="alt2" style="border: 1px inset ;">  Originally Posted by <strong>jlerv</strong> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/post/1376264"><img alt="View Post" border="0" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" /></a> <div style="font-style: italic;"> Thanks so much--do you have Yazmin&#39;s email address?<br /> I absolutely love this forum. I&#39;ve already learned so much from reading the previous posts!</div> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> Yazmin can be reached at <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="mailto:weddings1.drerc@dreamsresorts.com">weddings1.drerc@dreamsresorts.com</a></blockquote> <p> <br /> Thanks so much for this info, I sent my questions to Yazmin and hopefully will get a response soon. We&#39;ve tried calling the resort for a few days and cannot get through. Finally got a response to an email I sent out TWO MONTHS ago yesterday, but it is totally outdated and just so frustrating.<br /> <br /> &nbsp;</p> <blockquote class="ipsBlockquote">Originally Posted by <strong>kkvance</strong>&nbsp;<a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/thread/47576/dreams-riviera-cancun-brides-post-here-new-thread/3910#post_1376300"><img alt="View Post" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" style="border: 0px solid ;" /></a><br /> <br /> Could you email me with the script. <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="mailto:kkvance@yahoo.com">kkvance@yahoo.com</a></blockquote> <p> <br /> Could you please email me the script as well? dimesnnix@gmail.com. Thank you!<br /> <br /> &nbsp;</p> <blockquote class="ipsBlockquote">Originally Posted by <strong>rach2011</strong>&nbsp;<a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/thread/47576/dreams-riviera-cancun-brides-post-here-new-thread/3940#post_1379978"><img alt="View Post" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" style="border: 0px solid ;" /></a><br /> <br /> <p> @wisconsinbride - Was the $200 price based on a certain number of chairs?&nbsp; Was that utilizing &#39;her&#39; materials or you supplying and her just providing labor?&nbsp; Or was it whatever price sounded good to her at the time? lol...</p> </blockquote> <p> &nbsp;</p> <p> LOL...is this ridiculous to anyone else? Brides are paying to buy their own sashes, etc and then leave them at the resort and the hotel is charging new brides to use something the hotel never even paid for?!? Wow.<br /> <br /> &nbsp;</p>',
)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
