bsp;</p> <blockquote class="ipsBlockquote">Originally Posted by <strong>rach2011</strong>&nbsp;<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href="/forum/thread/47576/dreams-riviera-cancun-brides-post-here-new-thread/3940#post_1379978"><img alt="View Post" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" style="border: 0px solid ;" /></a><br /> <br /> <p> @wisconsinbride - Was the $200 price based on a certain number of chairs?&nbsp; Was that utilizing &#39;her&#39; materials or you supplying and her just providing labor?&nbsp; Or was it whatever price sounded good to her at the time? lol...</p> </blockquote> <p> &nbsp;</p> <p> LOL...is this ridiculous to anyone else? Brides are paying to buy their own sashes, etc and then leave them at the resort and the hotel is charging new brides to use something the hotel never even paid for?!? Wow.<br /> <br /> &nbsp;</p>
