array (
  'pid' => '1244747',
  'post' => '<br /> <br /> <blockquote class="ipsBlockquote">Originally Posted by <strong>jfazzina</strong>&nbsp;<a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/thread/47576/dreams-riviera-cancun-brides-post-here-new-thread/1780#post_1209461"><img alt="View Post" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" style="border-bottom: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-right: 0px solid" /></a><br /> <br /> <div style="margin: 5px 20px 20px"> <div class="smallfont" style="margin-bottom: 2px"> Quote:</div> <table border="0" cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" width="99%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="alt2" style="border-bottom: 1px inset; border-left: 1px inset; border-top: 1px inset; border-right: 1px inset">  Originally Posted by <strong>jfazzina</strong> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/post/1203133"><img alt="View Post" border="0" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" /></a> <div style="font-style: italic"> Chelsey,<br /> <br /> You will be getting married on the 5th of Nov!! Congrats!!! We will arrive at DRC either on Sunday or Monday the 8th! we are getting married on the 11th... Fill me in... We will have around 90 guests attending... what are your colors??</div> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> Chesley- Who are you using for a photgrapher?<br /> <br /> I just heard from Ana that it will cost me 650.00 to rent the PROJECTOR for the welcome party?? OK - this is INSANE!!! Again this has to be a mistake...</blockquote> <p> <br /> <br /> jfazzina:</p> <p> &nbsp;</p> <p> Sorry for all of the posts, but again, I&#39;m FINALLY catching up on the forum.&nbsp; We are actually using our cousin as the photographer.&nbsp; I think he will do a great job, we will be able to get the shots we want, and we will save majorly on the costs.&nbsp; The locations provides a great backdrop,so I think it will be tough to mess up the pictures.</p> <p> &nbsp;</p> <p> That is CRAZY about the projector....have you found out anything differently since you last posted?</p>',
