array (
  'pid' => '1244913',
  'post' => '<p> <br /> <br /> &nbsp;</p> <blockquote class="ipsBlockquote">Originally Posted by <strong>kmarch</strong>&nbsp;<a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/thread/61617/newbie-post-considering-dreams-palm-beach-punta-cana#post_1364997"><img alt="View Post" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" style="border-right: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-bottom: 0px solid" /></a><br /> <br /> <div style="margin: 5px 20px 20px"> <div class="smallfont" style="margin-bottom: 2px"> Quote:</div> <table border="0" cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" width="99%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="alt2" style="border-right: 1px inset; border-top: 1px inset; border-left: 1px inset; border-bottom: 1px inset">  Originally Posted by <strong>Canadiansandy</strong> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/post/1364376"><img alt="View Post" border="0" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" /></a> <div style="font-style: italic"> Congratulations and welcome! We are actually getting married at DPB as well (May 4 2011)! If you have any questions let me know, we&#39;ve done lots of planning already :)</div> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> Thanks, CanadianSandy. I&#39;d love to hear about your experience so far with DPB. I&#39;m concerned we&#39;re going to be too late booking! It&#39;s soon, but I don&#39;t want to wait it out through the summer.<br /> Going to the travel agent Tuesday! Wish me luck.<br /> K.</blockquote> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <blockquote class="ipsBlockquote">Originally Posted by <strong>Canadiansandy</strong>&nbsp;<a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/thread/61617/newbie-post-considering-dreams-palm-beach-punta-cana#post_1364376"><img alt="View Post" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" style="border-right: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-bottom: 0px solid" /></a><br /> <br /> Congratulations and welcome! We are actually getting married at DPB as well (May 4 2011)! If you have any questions let me know, we&#39;ve done lots of planning already :)</blockquote> <p> <br /> &nbsp;</p> <div class="wiki_markup" id="content_1389413"> <p> Hi Canadian Sandy,</p> <p> &nbsp;</p> <p> I&#39;m recently engaged and am also considering Dreams Palm Beach for my April 2011 wedding, but we are struggling trying to choose between several resorts (Paradisus PC, Majestic, Bahia Principie and DPB).&nbsp;What wast the deciding factor in choosing Dreams Palm Beach?&nbsp; Have you seen the resort?</p> <p> &nbsp;</p> <p> Thanks so much and any advice you can give this (slightly) anxious bride to be would be appreciated!</p> <p> &nbsp;</p> <p> I&#39;m still new to the forum and am still learning the ropes, so sorry if you received this message twice :)</p> <p> :)&#39;s,</p> <p> Lisa</p> </div> <p> <br /> &nbsp;</p>',
)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
