array (
  'pid' => '1247219',
  'post' => '<p> I wrote that comment after I received them!...I think they are great...cute and large enough to hold everything...definitely won&#39;t last forever but are a perfect OOT bag and guests will definitely use them to tote things to/from the beach and pool!</p> <blockquote class="ipsBlockquote">Originally Posted by <strong>Ms.H</strong>&nbsp;<a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/thread/52649/super-cheap-options-for-oot-bags/40#post_1374676"><img alt="View Post" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" style="border-bottom: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-right: 0px solid" /></a><br /> <br /> <div style="margin: 5px 20px 20px"> <div class="smallfont" style="margin-bottom: 2px"> Quote:</div> <table border="0" cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" width="99%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="alt2" style="border-bottom: 1px inset; border-left: 1px inset; border-top: 1px inset; border-right: 1px inset">  Originally Posted by <strong>Mallory57</strong> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/post/1275824"><img alt="View Post" border="0" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" /></a> <div style="font-style: italic"> Just wanted to let you ladies know that I ordered the Oriental Trading large hibiscus bags...they are great for the price! They definitely won&#39;t last forever (they are like a woven polyester type bag), but they are cute vibrant beachy bags perfect for OOT bags! I would recommend them for anyone trying to stick to a strict budget :-)</div> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> Hi Mallory,<br /> <br /> Did you get the bags yet? How are they? I&#39;m seriously considering these bags, just wondering what you thought of them once you received them.<br /> <br /> Thanks!</blockquote> <br /> <br />',
)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
