array (
  'pid' => '1250996',
  'post' => '<br /> <br /> <blockquote class="ipsBlockquote">Originally Posted by <strong>Hopelesslyblissful</strong>&nbsp;<a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/thread/42709/orange-and-aqua-wedding-colours/50#post_1327379"><img alt="View Post" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" style="border-bottom: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-right: 0px solid" /></a><br /> <br /> <div style="margin: 5px 20px 20px"> <div class="smallfont" style="margin-bottom: 2px"> Quote:</div> <table border="0" cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" width="99%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="alt2" style="border-bottom: 1px inset; border-left: 1px inset; border-top: 1px inset; border-right: 1px inset">  Originally Posted by <strong>aalva416</strong> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/post/1273228"><img alt="View Post" border="0" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" /></a> <div style="font-style: italic"> Hello ladies!<br /> Also an orange/blue bride here. (Though my blue is much darker.)<br /> Can\'t believe how much inspiration I\'m getting from you girls! It\'s a hard color combo to get a lot of ideas from!</div> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> I am also an orange/blue bride. My bridesmaids dresses are the convertible dress from Victoria Secret, and the groomsmens ties will be orange, and then orange accessories and other splashes of it throughout the wedding.<br /> <br /> My BM dresses (in cobalt)<br /> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="http://www2.victoriassecret.com/commerce/onlineProductDisplay.vs?namespace=productDisplay&amp;origin=onlineProductDisplay.jsp&amp;event=display&amp;prnbr=GP-250961&amp;cgname=OSKEYCLOZZZ&amp;rfnbr=6354">Victoria\'s Secret - Flirty Convertible Dress</a></blockquote> <p> <br /> <br /> We\'re doing the exact same bridesmaid dresses! Great minds think alike, lol!</p>',
)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
