array (
  'pid' => '1251406',
  'post' => '<p> Hi Again-</p> <p> Â </p> <p> I\'ve been looking at decor for the church. I think we are doing a long aisle runner that FI\'s father\'s company is making for us. We are also doing&nbsp; A LOT of flower petals on the ground and flowers at the pews with candles.&nbsp;</p> <p> Â </p> <p> As for the chapel - there are these white drapes that can go accross the top (ceiling part) that makes the chapel look GORGEOUS and classy. We got quoted $450 for these though!! Does anyone have better pricing?<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Â </p> <blockquote class="ipsBlockquote">Originally Posted by <strong>jdrewett</strong>&nbsp;<a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/thread/49450/catholic-chapels-xcaret-wedding-break-through/10#post_1329446"><img alt="View Post" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" style="border-right: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-bottom: 0px solid" /></a><br /> <br /> <div style="margin: 5px 20px 20px"> <div class="smallfont" style="margin-bottom: 2px"> Quote:</div> <table border="0" cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" width="99%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="alt2" style="border-right: 1px inset; border-top: 1px inset; border-left: 1px inset; border-bottom: 1px inset">  Originally Posted by <strong>anacj13</strong> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/post/1327201"><img alt="View Post" border="0" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" /></a> <div style="font-style: italic"> Exciting!!! I definitely want to do extra decor in terms of candles etc so great idea!! Our ceremony is at 2:30. What time are you doing yours?<br /> <br /> Also - how are you transporting all your guests? We are going to get buses but have to find good pricing options since we\'ll need two buses and limos too!</div> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> We decided to go with the 6pm time. I know it will be later, but we are doing photos before so we can go straight to partying. :)<br /> <br /> We are working with Weddings in Cancun. They have arranged group transportation at very affordable rates. I highly recommend them! Let me know if you want their contact information. I\'m not sure of the company they are using.</blockquote> <br /> <br />',
)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
