  'pid' => '1253876',
  'post' => '<br /> <br /> <blockquote class="ipsBlockquote"><br /> <br /> <div style="margin:20px; margin-top:5px; "> <div class="smallfont" style="margin-bottom:2px"> Quote:</div> <table border="0" cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" width="99%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="alt2" style="border:1px inset">  Originally Posted by <strong>t1219</strong> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/post/1327756"><img alt="View Post" border="0" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" /></a> <div style="font-style:italic"> I think this shell bouquet is kind of a neat idea:<br /> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="http://www.marthastewartweddings.com/article/shell-bouquet-how-to">Shell Bouquet How-To</a><br /> <br /> If you want to go the flower route I would just have your bridesmaids do a single flower.</div> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </blockquote> </div> <p> Â </p> <p> Love this idea. Thanks for posting<br /> Â </p>',
