array (
  'pid' => '1261948',
  'post' => '<br /> <br /> <blockquote class="ipsBlockquote">Originally Posted by <strong>*Karla*</strong>&nbsp;<a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/thread/18087/show-off-your-shoes/940#post_1371370"><img alt="View Post" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" style="border: 0px solid;" /></a><br /> <br /> I am a shoe girl, so I wore 4in heels! My WC put wooden planks down under the sand (so you couldn\'t see them), then an aisle runner. I rocked those shoes all night, and danced my butt off! But, I am used to heels.<br /> <br /> <div style="margin:20px; margin-top:5px; "> <div class="smallfont" style="margin-bottom:2px"> Quote:</div> <table border="0" cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" width="99%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="alt2" style="border:1px inset">  Originally Posted by <strong>hat0112</strong> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/post/1369520"><img alt="View Post" border="0" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" /></a> <div style="font-style:italic"> Because my FI is over a foot taller than me I am wearing heels (and I love wearing heels). We are having a hard isle runner put down so I wonâ€™t sink and I got 4â€ high heels. I also got wedge flip flops for during the reception when my feet hurt from dancing!<br /> <br /> These are my shoes:<br /> <br /> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="http://i780.photobucket.com/albums/yy86/hat0112/Pre-Wedding%20Pictures/Shoes.jpg"><img alt="Click the image to open in full size." border="0" class="tcattdimgresizer" src="http://i780.photobucket.com/albums/yy86/hat0112/Pre-Wedding%20Pictures/Shoes.jpg" /></a></div> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> Love these!</blockquote> <p> <br /> Those are hot</p>',
)
