 $35.<br /> <br /> <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href="http://i1021.photobucket.com/albums/af338/sorord1/weddshoe.jpg"><img alt="Click the image to open in full size." border="0" class="tcattdimgresizer" src="http://i1021.photobucket.com/albums/af338/sorord1/weddshoe.jpg" /></a></blockquote> <p> hot<br /> Â </p>
