array (
  'pid' => '1262357',
  'post' => '<p> <br /> LOL. Look, I was part of the PF before I was even here. What a stinkin worry wart I am.<br /> Â </p> <blockquote class="ipsBlockquote">Originally Posted by <strong>ErinB</strong>&nbsp;<a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/thread/1408/welcome-to-the-private-forums/350#post_738661"><img alt="View Post" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" style="border-right: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-bottom: 0px solid" /></a><br /> <br /> <div style="margin: 5px 20px 20px"> <div class="smallfont" style="margin-bottom: 2px"> Quote:</div> <table border="0" cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" width="99%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="alt2" style="border-right: 1px inset; border-top: 1px inset; border-left: 1px inset; border-bottom: 1px inset">  Originally Posted by <strong>kate.com</strong> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/post/738635"><img alt="View Post" border="0" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" /></a> <div style="font-style: italic"> Has anyone heard from Danille or Andrea?? MIA for awhile. Lori is on spring break, right? And heather? Look at me, little miss mother hen bc I have been around for a few days in a row, haha.</div> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> Uh oh girls! You\'ve been missed!</blockquote> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <blockquote class="ipsBlockquote">Originally Posted by <strong>~Andrea~</strong>&nbsp;<a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/thread/1408/welcome-to-the-private-forums/350#post_738898"><img alt="View Post" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" style="border-right: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-bottom: 0px solid" /></a><br /> <br /> Oh dang! Kate is so sweet for noticing though. I will get over there and post something. There are so many new shouters I seriously can\'t keep up anymore. I don\'t know how you do it Erin! You are for sure a superstar! :)</blockquote> <br /> <br />',
)
