array (
  'pid' => '1266218',
  'post' => '<p> I love how Lauren suddenly pops up on page 20</p> <p> Â </p> <p> Â </p> <div class="forum-post-date"> 7/25/08 at 10:16pm</div> <div class="shazam post-container-inner"> <div class="post-info-stat-cont shazam"> <div class="post-user-avatar"> <a class="thumblink" href="/user/lauren" rel="nofollow"><img height="80" rel="http://assets.bestdestinationwedding.com/5/5c/80x80px-LS-5ceaf305_avatar1829_2.gif" src="http://assets.bestdestinationwedding.com/5/5c/80x80px-LS-5ceaf305_avatar1829_2.gif" style="filter: alpha(opacity=100)" width="80" /> </a></div> <ul class="post-user-info"> <li class="post-username"> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/user/lauren">lauren </a></li> <li> Â </li> <li> <img class="user-badge-vert" src="/custom/huddle/bestdestinationwedding/img/badges/badge_elite.v1282682477.png" /></li> <li class="bannedBadge-1829"> Â </li> <li class="post-offline"> <span class="offline itext" title="">offline</span></li> </ul> <ul class="post-user-stats"> <li> Joined: June 2007</li> <li> Location: nj</li> <li> Post Count: 7,521</li> </ul> </div> <div class="post-content-area indexable"> <div class="wiki_markup" id="content_479849"> <h3 class="post-opt-title" id="title_479849"> Re: Alli - anyone try it?</h3> <div style="margin: 5px 20px 20px"> <div class="smallfont" style="margin-bottom: 2px"> Quote:</div> <table border="0" cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" width="99%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="alt2" style="border-bottom: 1px inset; border-left: 1px inset; border-top: 1px inset; border-right: 1px inset">  Originally Posted by <strong>tvt</strong> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/post/479824"><img alt="View Post" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" style="border-bottom: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-right: 0px solid" /></a> <div style="font-style: italic"> Ok girls, aside from weight loss, how do I know that Alli is working? Haven\'t had any weight loss yet, however it\'s only been a week and I know it can take a few to see results.<br /> <br /> I have not had a single side effect. Nothing is out of the normal for me... if you catch my drift. I wish there was some way to know if it was working.</div> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> lol, go to the nearest mcdonalds. you\'ll find out shortly after eating. <img alt="" class="inlineimg" src="http://files.bestdestinationwedding.com/images/smilies/rofl.gif" style="border-bottom: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-right: 0px solid" title="Rofl" /></div> </div> </div>',
)
