 I have not had a single side effect. Nothing is out of the normal for me... if you catch my drift. I wish there was some way to know if it was working.</div> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> lol, go to the nearest mcdonalds. you'll find out shortly after eating. <img alt="" class="inlineimg" src="http://files.bestdestinationwedding.com/images/smilies/rofl.gif" style="border-bottom: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-right: 0px solid" title="Rofl" /></div> </div> </div>
