array (
  'pid' => '1270565',
  'post' => '<br /> <br /> <blockquote class="ipsBlockquote">Originally Posted by <strong>LadyP</strong>&nbsp;<a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/thread/6334/how-many-sex-partners-have-you-had/20#post_98235"><img alt="View Post" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" style="border: 0px solid;" /></a><br /> <br /> <div style="margin: 5px 20px 20px;"> <div class="smallfont" style="margin-bottom: 2px;"> Quote:</div> <table border="0" cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" width="99%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="alt2" style="border: 1px inset;">  Originally Posted by <strong>MikkiStreak</strong> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/post/98201"><img alt="View Post" border="0" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" /></a> <div style="font-style: italic;"> Ok, well apparently I was a slut. I don\'t know the actual number, I\'d have to think about it. But I put in my ballpark number.<br /> <br /> Do I regret them? Hell yes. But it was the 80\'s in a small town and I actually had a much smaller number than most of my friends at the time. If I had to come up with a number since I matured into an adult---- it would be 3 in the last 15 years. The others were prior to the age of 21.</div> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> <strong>if my mother hadnt raised me with me with morals that would have been me. FREE. I had tried to play catch but had to fall in love with dbf so here I am</strong></blockquote> <p> <span style="color: rgb(255, 140, 0);">wow, she was not a nice girl...or at least didn\'t know how to say things in a nice way....</span><br /> Â </p> <blockquote class="ipsBlockquote">Originally Posted by <strong>MikkiStreak</strong>&nbsp;<a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/thread/6334/how-many-sex-partners-have-you-had/30#post_98875"><img alt="View Post" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" style="border: 0px solid;" /></a><br /> <br /> <div style="margin: 5px 20px 20px;"> <div class="smallfont" style="margin-bottom: 2px;"> Quote:</div> <table border="0" cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" width="99%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="alt2" style="border: 1px inset;">  Originally Posted by <strong>A10CALGAL</strong> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/post/98720"><img alt="View Post" border="0" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" /></a> <div style="font-style: italic;"> <br /> I\'m the only slut on this poll!</div> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> Ummm. nope, I join you there--- exact same situation for me.... I\'m in the higher count too and can\'t remember the exact number either....</blockquote> <p> <span style="color: rgb(255, 140, 0);">was trying to figure out who a10calgal was, but realized it\'s christa.</span></p> <p> Â </p> <div firebugversion="1.5.4" id="_firebugConsole" style="display: none;"> Â </div> <br />',
