d class="alt2" style="border: 1px inset;">  Originally Posted by <strong>A10CALGAL</strong> <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href="/forum/post/98720"><img alt="View Post" border="0" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" /></a> <div style="font-style: italic;"> <br /> I'm the only slut on this poll!</div> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> Ummm. nope, I join you there--- exact same situation for me.... I'm in the higher count too and can't remember the exact number either....</blockquote> <p> <span style="color: rgb(255, 140, 0);">was trying to figure out who a10calgal was, but realized it's christa.</span></p> <p> Â </p> <div firebugversion="1.5.4" id="_firebugConsole" style="display: none;"> Â </div> <br />
