> <p> I'm getting married at SGOR.<br /> <br /> Â </p> <blockquote class="ipsBlockquote">Originally Posted by <strong>CHAKLIT</strong>&nbsp;<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href="/forum/thread/49850/tell-me-about-your-photographer/50#post_1350047"><img alt="View Post" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" style="border-right: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-bottom: 0px solid" /></a><br /> <br /> <div style="margin: 5px 20px 20px"> <div class="smallfont"> Quote:</div> <table border="0" cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" width="99%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="alt2" style="border-right: 1px inset; border-top: 1px inset; border-left: 1px inset; border-bottom: 1px inset">  Originally Posted by <strong>Tennyt1</strong> <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href="/forum/post/1343675"><img alt="View Post" border="0" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" /></a> <div style="font-style: italic"> I wish we could share but we are getting married on the same day.</div> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> Wow...we sure are!<br /> <br /> Where are you getting married??</blockquote> <br /> <br />
