array (
  'pid' => '1288657',
  'post' => '<p> <br /> <br /> I love the second pair! Very hot. I like a show with a little pump action to it.</p> <blockquote class="ipsBlockquote">Originally Posted by <strong>aimee!</strong>&nbsp;<a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/thread/56531/on-the-hunt-for-purple-shoes#post_1214330"><img alt="View Post" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" style="border-bottom: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-right: 0px solid" /></a><br /> <br /> <div style="margin: 5px 20px 20px"> <div class="smallfont" style="margin-bottom: 2px"> Quote:</div> <table border="0" cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" width="99%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="alt2" style="border-bottom: 1px inset; border-left: 1px inset; border-top: 1px inset; border-right: 1px inset">  Originally Posted by <strong>Tlseege</strong> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/post/1213794"><img alt="View Post" border="0" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" /></a> <div style="font-style: italic"> Zappos!!! Free shipping to you, free shipping back! I will buy a bunch and then try them all on and ship back the ones I don\'t keep! It works PERFECT for finding that right pair of wedding shoes! :)<br /> <br /> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="http://a1.zassets.com/images/752/7523111/6901-950875-d.jpg"><img alt="Click the image to open in full size." border="0" class="tcattdimgresizer" src="http://a1.zassets.com/images/752/7523111/6901-950875-d.jpg" /></a><br /> <br /> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="http://a1.zassets.com/images/z/1/0/3/1034634-p-DETAILED.jpg"><img alt="Click the image to open in full size." border="0" class="tcattdimgresizer" src="http://a1.zassets.com/images/z/1/0/3/1034634-p-DETAILED.jpg" /></a></div> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> The top pair (nina?) is my favorite in every color! I seriously need to own a pair of those <img alt="" border="0" class="inlineimg" src="http://files.bestdestinationwedding.com/images/smilies/wink.gif" title="Wink" /><br /> <br /> I would also try endless.com &amp; heels.com you can search by color :)</blockquote> <br /> <br />',
)
