  'pid' => '1289243',
  'post' => '<p> <br /> Hey!</p> <p> Â </p> <p> If you could send me a copy to <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="mailto:kmronalds@hotmail.com">kmronalds@hotmail.com</a> I\'d really apprecate it.</p> <p> Â </p> <p> Thanks!</p> <p> Kim<br /> Â </p> <blockquote class="ipsBlockquote">Originally Posted by <strong>midnight24</strong>&nbsp;<a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/thread/786/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here/3110#post_1359921"><img alt="View Post" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" style="border-bottom: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-right: 0px solid" /></a><br /> <br /> <div style="margin: 5px 20px 20px"> <div class="smallfont" style="margin-bottom: 2px"> Quote:</div> <table border="0" cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" width="99%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="alt2" style="border-bottom: 1px inset; border-left: 1px inset; border-top: 1px inset; border-right: 1px inset">  Originally Posted by <strong>jennster_04</strong> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/post/1352122"><img alt="View Post" border="0" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" /></a> <div style="font-style: italic"> does anyone have any templates they can share that they used at gran bahia principe<img alt="" border="0" class="inlineimg" src="http://files.bestdestinationwedding.com/images/smilies/huh.gif" title="Huh" />??</div> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> i have a template that i made to email guests (they could print) that i sent before the trip.<br /> <br /> it\'s like a \'welcome/what to bring\' newsletter with info about the resort etc.<br /> <br /> pm if you would like a copy</blockquote> <br /> <br />',
