array (
  'pid' => '1307925',
  'post' => '<p> <br /> Here is my original request on 5/2/2010:</p> <blockquote class="ipsBlockquote">Originally Posted by <strong>Diva</strong>&nbsp;<a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/thread/19677/starfish-passing-thread/620#post_1279178"><img alt="View Post" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" style="border: 0px solid;" /></a><br /> <br /> can someone add me to the blue list please?? March 14, 2011...</blockquote> <p> <br /> <br /> Here is Karla\'s reply on 5/4/2010:<br /> &nbsp;</p> <blockquote class="ipsBlockquote">Originally Posted by <strong>*Karla*</strong>&nbsp;<a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/thread/19677/starfish-passing-thread/620#post_1280957"><img alt="View Post" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" style="border: 0px solid;" /></a><br /> <br /> <div style="margin:20px; margin-top:5px; "> <div class="smallfont" style="margin-bottom:2px"> Quote:</div> <table border="0" cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" width="99%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="alt2" style="border:1px inset">  Originally Posted by <strong>krishna69z</strong> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/post/1275967"><img alt="View Post" border="0" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" /></a> <div style="font-style:italic"> I\'d love to be added to the blue starfish list, I\'m traveling to Varadero, Cuba Nov 26th - Dec 4, 2010</div> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> <div style="margin:20px; margin-top:5px; "> <div class="smallfont" style="margin-bottom:2px"> Quote:</div> <table border="0" cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" width="99%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="alt2" style="border:1px inset">  Originally Posted by <strong>futur_bride</strong> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/post/1279084"><img alt="View Post" border="0" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" /></a> <div style="font-style:italic"> Can you put me on the list?<br /> April 14 2011 Riviera Maya</div> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> <div style="margin:20px; margin-top:5px; "> <div class="smallfont" style="margin-bottom:2px"> Quote:</div> <table border="0" cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" width="99%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="alt2" style="border:1px inset">  Originally Posted by <strong>Diva</strong> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/post/1279178"><img alt="View Post" border="0" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" /></a> <div style="font-style:italic"> can someone add me to the blue list please?? March 14, 2011...</div> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> We can get you in.<br /> <br /> UPDATE:<br /> <strong><u>Karla\'s <font color="DeepSkyBlue">Blue Starfish</font> Passing List - Wedding Date in ()</u></strong><br /> <br /> Martine (Chicken764) - Punta Cana April 7- April 14, 2010<br /> Kelly (Bakersgirl) - Whitehouse, JA April 30-May 9, 2010 (May 2)<br /> Island Bride - Captiva Island, FL May 23, 2010<br /> Nikki (Staceysbride) - Punta Cana June 7-June 21, 2010 (June 10)<br /> brezzie - St. Lucia Aug 4-Aug 14, 2010 (Aug 4)<br /> wendyjd - Jamaica Oct 7-Oct 15, 2010 (Oct 11)<br /> krishna69z - Valadero, Cuba Nov 26-Dec 4, 2010<br /> Brandi (bnbrmy) - Cabo San Lucas Jan 6, 2011<br /> Diva - Excellence Punta Cana March 14, 2011<br /> futur_bride - Riviera Maya April 14, 2011<br /> susanna.hanson - Cabo San Luca June 17, 2011<br /> <br /> Anyone else, let me know!<br /> <br /> For those wondering what the blue starfish looks like, here is a pic from my bouquet: <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="http://i992.photobucket.com/albums/af49/KarlaSmith7/Pro%20Pics/bouquet.jpg"><img alt="Click the image to open in full size." border="0" class="tcattdimgresizer" src="http://i992.photobucket.com/albums/af49/KarlaSmith7/Pro%20Pics/bouquet.jpg" /></a></blockquote> <p> <br /> Looks like Ania was not on the list when I was added on, the person right before me was in January, which means my request was probably the first one. &nbsp;Again, not to step on toes, but there is NO way that she can guarantee I will get it from the UK in 18 days. &nbsp;I think some adjustments need to be made to the list so we can keep this thing going.</p> <p> &nbsp;</p> <p> Sorry guys, I am an attorney, what do you expect!LOL &nbsp;;-)</p>',
)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
> Time: 1395962206 / Thu, 27 Mar 2014 23:16:46 +0000
> URL: /admin/index.php?adsess=845f6c850772369311b67ecf8645904c&app=forums&module=forums&section=fix&st=158250
> <p> <br /> Here is my original request on 5/2/2010:</p> <blockquote class="ipsBlockquote">Originally Posted by <strong>Diva</strong>&nbsp;<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href="/forum/thread/19677/starfish-passing-thread/620#post_1279178"><img alt="View Post" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" style="border: 0px solid;" /></a><br /> <br /> can someone add me to the blue list please?? March 14, 2011...</blockquote> <p> <br /> <br /> Here is Karla's reply on 5/4/2010:<br /> &nbsp;</p> <blockquote class="ipsBlockquote">Originally Posted by <strong>*Karla*</strong>&nbsp;<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href="/forum/thread/19677/starfish-passing-thread/620#post_1280957"><img alt="View Post" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" style="border: 0px solid;" /></a><br /> <br /> <div style="margin:20px; margin-top:5px; "> <div class="smallfont"> Quote:</div> <table border="0" cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" width="99%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="alt2" style="border:1px inset">  Originally Posted by <strong>krishna69z</strong> <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href="/forum/post/1275967"><img alt="View Post" border="0" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" /></a> <div style="font-style:italic"> I'd love to be added to the blue starfish list, I'm traveling to Varadero, Cuba Nov 26th - Dec 4, 2010</div> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> <div style="margin:20px; margin-top:5px; "> <div class="smallfont"> Quote:</div> <table border="0" cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" width="99%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="alt2" style="border:1px inset">  Originally Posted by <strong>futur_bride</strong> <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href="/forum/post/1279084"><img alt="View Post" border="0" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" /></a> <div style="font-style:italic"> Can you put me on the list?<br /> April 14 2011 Riviera Maya</div> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> <div style="margin:20px; margin-top:5px; "> <div class="smallfont"> Quote:</div> <table border="0" cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" width="99%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="alt2" style="border:1px inset">  Originally Posted by <strong>Diva</strong> <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href="/forum/post/1279178"><img alt="View Post" border="0" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" /></a> <div style="font-style:italic"> can someone add me to the blue list please?? March 14, 2011...</div> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> We can get you in.<br /> <br /> UPDATE:<br /> <strong><u>Karla's <font color="DeepSkyBlue">Blue Starfish</font> Passing List - Wedding Date in ()</u></strong><br /> <br /> Martine (Chicken764) - Punta Cana April 7- April 14, 2010<br /> Kelly (Bakersgirl) - Whitehouse, JA April 30-May 9, 2010 (May 2)<br /> Island Bride - Captiva Island, FL May 23, 2010<br /> Nikki (Staceysbride) - Punta Cana June 7-June 21, 2010 (June 10)<br /> brezzie - St. Lucia Aug 4-Aug 14, 2010 (Aug 4)<br /> wendyjd - Jamaica Oct 7-Oct 15, 2010 (Oct 11)<br /> krishna69z - Valadero, Cuba Nov 26-Dec 4, 2010<br /> Brandi (bnbrmy) - Cabo San Lucas Jan 6, 2011<br /> Diva - Excellence Punta Cana March 14, 2011<br /> futur_bride - Riviera Maya April 14, 2011<br /> susanna.hanson - Cabo San Luca June 17, 2011<br /> <br /> Anyone else, let me know!<br /> <br /> For those wondering what the blue starfish looks like, here is a pic from my bouquet: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href="http://i992.photobucket.com/albums/af49/KarlaSmith7/Pro%20Pics/bouquet.jpg"><img alt="Click the image to open in full size." border="0" class="tcattdimgresizer" src="http://i992.photobucket.com/albums/af49/KarlaSmith7/Pro%20Pics/bouquet.jpg" /></a></blockquote> <p> <br /> Looks like Ania was not on the list when I was added on, the person right before me was in January, which means my request was probably the first one. &nbsp;Again, not to step on toes, but there is NO way that she can guarantee I will get it from the UK in 18 days. &nbsp;I think some adjustments need to be made to the list so we can keep this thing going.</p> <p> &nbsp;</p> <p> Sorry guys, I am an attorney, what do you expect!LOL &nbsp;;-)</p>
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
