array (
  'pid' => '1308953',
  'post' => '<p> <br /> <br /> what are you thinking about your cake Southern Swettie? I\'m with you on this one, being someone who bakes and decorates cakes myself.. I have a family friend that also has her own business decorating cakes and she wants to just bring the whole thing ---but that makes me nervous as well. I think my compromise might be is to get a plain tiered cake from MP and then bring my own sugar flowers to adorn it</p> <blockquote class="ipsBlockquote">Originally Posted by <strong>SouthernSweetie</strong>&nbsp;<a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/thread/56044/moon-palace-2011-brides/30#post_1301844"><img alt="View Post" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" style="border-bottom: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-right: 0px solid" /></a><br /> <br /> <div style="margin: 5px 20px 20px"> <div class="smallfont" style="margin-bottom: 2px"> Quote:</div> <table border="0" cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" width="99%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="alt2" style="border-bottom: 1px inset; border-left: 1px inset; border-top: 1px inset; border-right: 1px inset">  Originally Posted by <strong>DiamondGirl</strong> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/post/1298751"><img alt="View Post" border="0" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" /></a> <div style="font-style: italic"> Hi ladies,<br /> anyone have information on the resort videographer? am I better off getting an outside videographer as recommended with photographer?</div> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> I guess that it depends on how picky you are...I\'ve heard mixed reviews about the video quality. The one negative thing that I\'ve read pretty consistently is that the editing is not exactly smooth. Some brides laughed about it and others did not think that it was cute.<br /> <br /> The two things that I refuse to compromise on are photography and food - especially the cake. I am definitely a cake snob. For me, an outside videographer will depend on whether I have extra funds after I pay for the must-haves.</blockquote> <br /> <br />',
)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
> Time: 1395962206 / Thu, 27 Mar 2014 23:16:46 +0000
