array (
  'pid' => '1308998',
  'post' => '<p> <br /> <br /> and as a Palace member, me and my wedding guests (using my family\'s membership number) will be getting the transfers for free...</p> <blockquote class="ipsBlockquote">Originally Posted by <strong>KGirl99</strong>&nbsp;<a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/thread/58154/moon-palace-wedding-coordinator-questions/30#post_1310833"><img alt="View Post" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" style="border-bottom: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-right: 0px solid" /></a><br /> <br /> <div style="margin: 5px 20px 20px"> <div class="smallfont" style="margin-bottom: 2px"> Quote:</div> <table border="0" cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" width="99%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="alt2" style="border-bottom: 1px inset; border-left: 1px inset; border-top: 1px inset; border-right: 1px inset">  Originally Posted by <strong>alison15</strong> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/post/1285454"><img alt="View Post" border="0" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" /></a> <div style="font-style: italic"> I know our guests are all set up with a shuttle. I think the biggest issue is waiting for the shuttle to fill up as they don\'t make single trips. The shuttle will stop at several resort but MP is the closest so it should be the first stop. I think if you have to wait a while at the airport, it would be frustrating as the actual shuttle ride will only be 15 mins. Waiting for the shuttle is the worst b/c you are so excited to be there and you just want to get to the resort and get out in the sun!</div> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> <br /> I know that you can arrange your airport transfers through MP. You can go onto their website for reservations. I think it\'s $10 per person.</blockquote> <br /> <br />',
)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
> Time: 1395962206 / Thu, 27 Mar 2014 23:16:46 +0000
