array (
  'pid' => '1310938',
  'post' => '<p> <br /> <br /> it is encouraging to see that ticket prices were this cheap at some point in the year...because my guests are flipping out with the 500 dollar prices for round trip being quoted right now...</p> <blockquote class="ipsBlockquote">Originally Posted by <strong>vgirl17</strong>&nbsp;<a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/thread/47883/moon-palace-2010-brides/270#post_1085956"><img alt="View Post" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" style="border-bottom: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-right: 0px solid" /></a><br /> <br /> <div style="margin: 5px 20px 20px"> <div class="smallfont" style="margin-bottom: 2px"> Quote:</div> <table border="0" cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" width="99%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="alt2" style="border-bottom: 1px inset; border-left: 1px inset; border-top: 1px inset; border-right: 1px inset">  Originally Posted by <strong>doblauvelt</strong> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/post/1085856"><img alt="View Post" border="0" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" /></a> <div style="font-style: italic"> Wow you guys already booked your flights? Looks like I\'m behind on something. I\'ve just been watching the rates, they were at $290 a few months ago but now they jumped to $301 from Newark, NJ.</div> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> Looks like they have flights out of NJ for $281 through Continental right now. I used Expedia Alert (you can download it from their site) on my computer to alert me when rates changed (up and down). I also went to the individual airlines themselves to see what their prices were when air went down. :)</blockquote> <br /> <br />',
)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
