> <p> <br /> <br /> Gorgeous pictures!!!!</p> <blockquote class="ipsBlockquote">Originally Posted by <strong>jillhiggins</strong>&nbsp;<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href="/forum/thread/3708/lenita-s-moon-palace-wedding-review/50#post_53163"><img alt="View Post" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" style="border-bottom: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-right: 0px solid" /></a><br /> <br /> <div style="margin: 5px 20px 20px"> <div class="smallfont"> Quote:</div> <table border="0" cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" width="99%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="alt2" style="border-bottom: 1px inset; border-left: 1px inset; border-top: 1px inset; border-right: 1px inset">  Originally Posted by <strong>Julesr</strong> <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href="/forum/post/53157"><img alt="View Post" border="0" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" /></a> <div style="font-style: italic"> Okay, I am really late on this post, I moved cities and all, so have not been here much for a long time. How come I can't see your wedding pics, it takes me to a main page, and I do not know where to go from there, please help, I am dying to see them.</div> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> Julie,<br /> <br /> Try going here first:<br /> <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href="http://jillhigginsphotography.blogspot.com/2007/03/lenita-andres-wedding-in-mexico.html">Lenita &amp; Andre's Pics</a><br /> <br /> :)</blockquote> <br /> <br />
