array (
  'pid' => '1316802',
  'post' => '<p> <br /> <br /> Thanks for sharing, those are great!</p> <blockquote class="ipsBlockquote">Originally Posted by <strong>ashnic2005</strong>&nbsp;<a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/thread/47883/moon-palace-2010-brides/820#post_1201217"><img alt="View Post" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" style="border-bottom: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-right: 0px solid" /></a><br /> <br /> <div style="margin: 5px 20px 20px"> <div class="smallfont" style="margin-bottom: 2px"> Quote:</div> <table border="0" cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" width="99%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="alt2" style="border-bottom: 1px inset; border-left: 1px inset; border-top: 1px inset; border-right: 1px inset">  Originally Posted by <strong>Scorpio30</strong> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/post/1200721"><img alt="View Post" border="0" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" /></a> <div style="font-style: italic"> Ashley - is Tammsphoto based in Mexico?</div> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> They are actually based in the States. However, they have done quite a few weddings at moon palace. They also include in their package a &quot;honeymoon photoshoot&quot; that can be either done the day before or after your wedding. They are a husband and wife photography group so the husband will follow the guys and the wife will follow the ladies prior to the wedding. Another addition is that since vendors are required to stay on site...they will give you a discount on price. They took $500.00 off of my package since I had to pay for a room. Below are some moon palace weddings done by Tammsphotos.<br /> <br /> Palace Weddings<br /> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="http://www.tammsphotos.com/anss/">Andrea &amp; Nick</a><br /> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="http://www.tammsphotos.com/rnashow/">Anne &amp; Ryan</a><br /> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="http://www.tammsphotos.com/jnl/">Lorrie &amp; Jeff</a><br /> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="http://www.tammsphotos.com/ginajimmy/">Gina &amp; Jimmy</a><br /> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="http://www.tammsphotos.com/greenss/">Tameka &amp; Jason</a></blockquote> <br /> <br />',
)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
> Time: 1395962206 / Thu, 27 Mar 2014 23:16:46 +0000
> URL: /admin/index.php?adsess=845f6c850772369311b67ecf8645904c&app=forums&module=forums&section=fix&st=158250
> <p> <br /> <br /> Thanks for sharing, those are great!</p> <blockquote class="ipsBlockquote">Originally Posted by <strong>ashnic2005</strong>&nbsp;<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href="/forum/thread/47883/moon-palace-2010-brides/820#post_1201217"><img alt="View Post" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" style="border-bottom: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-right: 0px solid" /></a><br /> <br /> <div style="margin: 5px 20px 20px"> <div class="smallfont"> Quote:</div> <table border="0" cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" width="99%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="alt2" style="border-bottom: 1px inset; border-left: 1px inset; border-top: 1px inset; border-right: 1px inset">  Originally Posted by <strong>Scorpio30</strong> <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href="/forum/post/1200721"><img alt="View Post" border="0" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" /></a> <div style="font-style: italic"> Ashley - is Tammsphoto based in Mexico?</div> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> They are actually based in the States. However, they have done quite a few weddings at moon palace. They also include in their package a &quot;honeymoon photoshoot&quot; that can be either done the day before or after your wedding. They are a husband and wife photography group so the husband will follow the guys and the wife will follow the ladies prior to the wedding. Another addition is that since vendors are required to stay on site...they will give you a discount on price. They took $500.00 off of my package since I had to pay for a room. Below are some moon palace weddings done by Tammsphotos.<br /> <br /> Palace Weddings<br /> <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href="http://www.tammsphotos.com/anss/">Andrea &amp; Nick</a><br /> <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href="http://www.tammsphotos.com/rnashow/">Anne &amp; Ryan</a><br /> <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href="http://www.tammsphotos.com/jnl/">Lorrie &amp; Jeff</a><br /> <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href="http://www.tammsphotos.com/ginajimmy/">Gina &amp; Jimmy</a><br /> <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href="http://www.tammsphotos.com/greenss/">Tameka &amp; Jason</a></blockquote> <br /> <br />
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
