array (
  'pid' => '1341651',
  'post' => '<p> <br /> <br /> OMG I love these... so adorable.</p> <blockquote class="ipsBlockquote">Originally Posted by <strong>TLGnhci</strong>&nbsp;<a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/thread/59914/my-wedding-planning-ect-pics/30#post_1372740"><img alt="View Post" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" style="border-bottom: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-right: 0px solid" /></a><br /> <br /> <div style="margin: 5px 20px 20px"> <div class="smallfont" style="margin-bottom: 2px"> Quote:</div> <table border="0" cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" width="99%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="alt2" style="border-bottom: 1px inset; border-left: 1px inset; border-top: 1px inset; border-right: 1px inset">  Originally Posted by <strong>ashley1316</strong> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/post/1325456"><img alt="View Post" border="0" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" /></a> <div style="font-style: italic"> here are our table numbers/names. i am going to get a small tip marker and write the names of the guest on it. long story short, my FI and i met on lawn chairs.<br /> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="http://i1038.photobucket.com/albums/a464/ashley0708_2011/chair.jpg"><img alt="Click the image to open in full size." border="0" class="tcattdimgresizer" src="http://i1038.photobucket.com/albums/a464/ashley0708_2011/chair.jpg" /></a></div> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> This is just too darn cute!!</blockquote> <br /> <br />',
