ick the image to open in full size." border="0" class="tcattdimgresizer" src="http://i780.photobucket.com/albums/yy86/hat0112/Pre-Wedding%20Pictures/Shoes.jpg" /></a></div> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> Love these!</blockquote> <p> <br /> Those are hot</p> </div> </div> <br /> <br />
