array (
  'pid' => '1348737',
  'post' => '<br /> <br /> <blockquote class="ipsBlockquote">Originally Posted by <strong>pamphilia</strong>&nbsp;<a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/thread/34234/majestic-colonial-or-elegance-brides-post-here/800#post_1321180"><img alt="View Post" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" style="border-bottom: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-right: 0px solid" /></a><br /> <br /> <div style="margin: 5px 20px 20px"> <div class="smallfont" style="margin-bottom: 2px"> Quote:</div> <table border="0" cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" width="99%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="alt2" style="border-bottom: 1px inset; border-left: 1px inset; border-top: 1px inset; border-right: 1px inset">  Originally Posted by <strong>jkgirl83</strong> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/post/1321137"><img alt="View Post" border="0" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" /></a> <div style="font-style: italic"> Cristina I\'m not sure about rates for Spring, but I have been getting group rates coming back around $1,600 per person for early January my travel agent suggested to wait a little bit but that normally the sale/last minute rates aren\'t that much cheaper and sometimes aren\'t available for the Colonial. Not sure if this is true...but it\'s what I was told. Congrats on your engagement!! Good luck with everything!<br /> <br /> Lisa and Pam - glad to hear from some January brides!! What location and times did you go with for your ceremonies? Are you doing a private dinner or reception?</div> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> hi jkgirl!<br /> <br /> we are doing a symbolic beach ceremony with Pastor York at 4pm.<br /> <br /> we are having the included dinner at the steakhouse, and then having a private reception at the Parrot or Wet Bar (depending on the number of guests)..<br /> <br /> ...i am also waiting on some better rates for January. i am a travel agent, and am getting impatient with myself...LOL.</blockquote> <p> <br /> <br /> We are also going&nbsp;with the included&nbsp;dinner at the steakhouse.&nbsp; We booked the wet bar for a private reception after.&nbsp; Have you decided which place to go with?&nbsp;&nbsp;I\'m trying to get idea\'s of how to decorate.&nbsp;</p>',
)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
> Time: 1395962206 / Thu, 27 Mar 2014 23:16:46 +0000
> URL: /admin/index.php?adsess=845f6c850772369311b67ecf8645904c&app=forums&module=forums&section=fix&st=158250
> <br /> <br /> <blockquote class="ipsBlockquote">Originally Posted by <strong>pamphilia</strong>&nbsp;<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href="/forum/thread/34234/majestic-colonial-or-elegance-brides-post-here/800#post_1321180"><img alt="View Post" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" style="border-bottom: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-right: 0px solid" /></a><br /> <br /> <div style="margin: 5px 20px 20px"> <div class="smallfont"> Quote:</div> <table border="0" cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" width="99%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="alt2" style="border-bottom: 1px inset; border-left: 1px inset; border-top: 1px inset; border-right: 1px inset">  Originally Posted by <strong>jkgirl83</strong> <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href="/forum/post/1321137"><img alt="View Post" border="0" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" /></a> <div style="font-style: italic"> Cristina I'm not sure about rates for Spring, but I have been getting group rates coming back around $1,600 per person for early January my travel agent suggested to wait a little bit but that normally the sale/last minute rates aren't that much cheaper and sometimes aren't available for the Colonial. Not sure if this is true...but it's what I was told. Congrats on your engagement!! Good luck with everything!<br /> <br /> Lisa and Pam - glad to hear from some January brides!! What location and times did you go with for your ceremonies? Are you doing a private dinner or reception?</div> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> hi jkgirl!<br /> <br /> we are doing a symbolic beach ceremony with Pastor York at 4pm.<br /> <br /> we are having the included dinner at the steakhouse, and then having a private reception at the Parrot or Wet Bar (depending on the number of guests)..<br /> <br /> ...i am also waiting on some better rates for January. i am a travel agent, and am getting impatient with myself...LOL.</blockquote> <p> <br /> <br /> We are also going&nbsp;with the included&nbsp;dinner at the steakhouse.&nbsp; We booked the wet bar for a private reception after.&nbsp; Have you decided which place to go with?&nbsp;&nbsp;I'm trying to get idea's of how to decorate.&nbsp;</p>
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
> Time: 1395962206 / Thu, 27 Mar 2014 23:16:46 +0000
> URL: /admin/index.php?adsess=845f6c850772369311b67ecf8645904c&app=forums&module=forums&section=fix&st=158250
> 
array (
  'pid' => '1348796',
  'post' => '<p> <br /> I LOVE your designs! Where did you get your OOT stuff done?</p> <blockquote class="ipsBlockquote">Originally Posted by <strong>omsampad</strong>&nbsp;<a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/thread/58524/oot-bags-avoids/30#post_1293323"><img alt="View Post" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" style="border: 0px solid;" /></a><br /> <br /> <div style="margin: 5px 20px 20px;"> <div class="smallfont" style="margin-bottom: 2px;"> Quote:</div> <table border="0" cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" width="99%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="alt2" style="border: 1px inset;">  Originally Posted by <strong>n&amp;n112109</strong> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/post/1291543"><img alt="View Post" border="0" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" /></a> <div style="font-style: italic;"> I was super excited about the OOT bags... My guests loved them! My advice is to keep them simple! The cost can really get out of hand.<br /> <br /> I had..<br /> <br /> A brown handled bag with our Logo<br /> 2 Koozie\'s with our logo<br /> 2 Cups with our logo<br /> 2 Luggage tags<br /> A map of Cancun<br /> Welcome Letter<br /> First aid kit with Ibuprofen,Neosporin,Bandaids,Immodium, Aloe vera gel, Sunblock and Pepto tabs.<br /> <br /> I know everything but the aloe vera gel was used. The resort had mini fridges stocked with M&amp;M\'s, candy bars, bottled water, soda and beer. We also had liquor dispensers in the room so we stayed away from adding any of that in the bags.<br /> <br /> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="http://i98.photobucket.com/albums/l263/ndb678/IMG_1308.jpg"><img alt="Click the image to open in full size." border="0" class="tcattdimgresizer" src="http://i98.photobucket.com/albums/l263/ndb678/IMG_1308.jpg" /></a></div> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> <br /> Love your oot stuff!!!!</blockquote> <br /> <br />',
)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
> Time: 1395962206 / Thu, 27 Mar 2014 23:16:46 +0000
