array (
  'pid' => '1374721',
  'post' => '<p> i ordered from pioneer group at www.glass-html or&nbsp;www.pioneergroup27.com. &nbsp;For two dozen it $54.00 plus $15.00 in shipping and tax for a total of $69. &nbsp;I had to call them with my credit card info and they said they would ship them out that day. i should have them in two days which will be tomorrow. &nbsp;I would send them an email of what you want and see what they say. &nbsp;It take a few days to get a response initially but once they did they were very quick. &nbsp;So I hope they are nice. I was about to write having pashminas off but this worked well into my budget! Good luck<br /> &nbsp;</p> <blockquote class="ipsBlockquote">Originally Posted by <strong>msjulie5475</strong>&nbsp;<a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/thread/56503/new-pashmina-order/130#post_1520300"><img alt="View Post" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" style="border: 0px solid;" /></a><br /> <br /> <p> &quot;Less is More&quot; where did you place your order?&nbsp; Please would you post or PM the contact information?<br /> &nbsp;</p> <div class="quote-container"> <span>Quote:</span> <div class="quote-block"> Originally Posted by <strong>Less is more</strong>&nbsp;<a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/thread/56503/new-pashmina-order/130#post_1519515"><img alt="View Post" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" style="border: 0px solid;" /></a><br /> <br /> <p> Thanks so much for posting the info. &nbsp;I called them and the first man i talked to said no and that i had to order atleast $100 worth and i didn\'t need that many. &nbsp;So me being persistant i emailed them. &nbsp;I finally got a response and it was good! &nbsp;I asked to 2 dozen and he quoted me &nbsp;$2.25ea with out shipping. &nbsp;So i said yes! I will call them during business hours and give my card info. &nbsp;Thank you so much for posting avong1228! &nbsp;Let me know how yours turn out please! &nbsp;<br /> &nbsp;</p> <div class="quote-container"> <span>Quote:</span> <div class="quote-block"> Originally Posted by <strong>avong1228</strong>&nbsp;<a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/thread/56503/new-pashmina-order/120#post_1362991"><img alt="View Post" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" style="border: 0px solid;" /></a><br /> <br /> <div style="margin: 5px 20px 20px;"> <div class="smallfont" style="margin-bottom: 2px;"> Quote:</div> <table border="0" cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" width="99%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="alt2" style="border: 1px inset;">  Originally Posted by <strong>nmurch</strong> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/post/1361801"><img alt="View Post" border="0" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" /></a> <div style="font-style: italic;"> where did u purchase them from</div> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> From this same vendor. I just went on the website and they emailed me the quote and I called with my credit card information. He said they\'ll ship today!</blockquote> <br /> &nbsp;</div> </div> <br /> &nbsp;</div> </div> <br /> <br />',
)
