array (
  'pid' => '1380887',
  'post' => '<p> <br /> YOUR DRESS IS VEERRRRY PRETTY! I\'M GOING TO DRESS SHOPPING NEXT WEEKEND FOR MINE. CAN\'T WAIT!!</p> <blockquote class="ipsBlockquote">Originally Posted by <strong>21aholden</strong>&nbsp;<a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/thread/58515/june-2011-brides#post_1286256"><img alt="View Post" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" style="border: 0px solid;" /></a><br /> <br /> <div style="margin: 5px 20px 20px;"> <div class="smallfont" style="margin-bottom: 2px;"> Quote:</div> <table border="0" cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" width="99%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="alt2" style="border: 1px inset;">  Originally Posted by <strong>peterpanpixiedust</strong> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/post/1285299"><img alt="View Post" border="0" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" /></a> <div style="font-style: italic;"> June 18th at Dreams Cancun! Wow, we all are so close to eachother! I have gone dress shopping. I ordered my dress and my TTD. They told me 8 months for my dress, and I ordered it in February. Tooo long! My TTD is from Gianinar (knock off) and that is only supposed to take 30-45 days, but we are on day 50 now... haha!<br /> Here\'s my dress (Sottero &amp; Midgely). I&quot;m having a corset added<br /> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="http://i37.photobucket.com/albums/e79/peterpanpixiedust/DSC05041.jpg"><img alt="Click the image to open in full size." border="0" class="tcattdimgresizer" src="http://i37.photobucket.com/albums/e79/peterpanpixiedust/DSC05041.jpg" /></a><a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="http://i37.photobucket.com/albums/e79/peterpanpixiedust/DSC05039.jpg"><img alt="Click the image to open in full size." border="0" class="tcattdimgresizer" src="http://i37.photobucket.com/albums/e79/peterpanpixiedust/DSC05039.jpg" /></a><br /> <br /> here is inspiration for TTD knockoff<br /> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="http://www.amymichelson.com/popup_diamond.html">amy michelson : Diamond</a><br /> <br /> Everyone else please show off your finds (be it dress, favors, invites, anything... I\'m so unsure of what to do yet)</div> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> Love your dress, so pretty! I have no good finds yet...I have 3 of my besties getting married this summer so I have been super busy helping them!</blockquote> <br /> <br />',
)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
> Time: 1395962206 / Thu, 27 Mar 2014 23:16:46 +0000
> URL: /admin/index.php?adsess=845f6c850772369311b67ecf8645904c&app=forums&module=forums&section=fix&st=158250
> <p> <br /> YOUR DRESS IS VEERRRRY PRETTY! I'M GOING TO DRESS SHOPPING NEXT WEEKEND FOR MINE. CAN'T WAIT!!</p> <blockquote class="ipsBlockquote">Originally Posted by <strong>21aholden</strong>&nbsp;<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href="/forum/thread/58515/june-2011-brides#post_1286256"><img alt="View Post" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" style="border: 0px solid;" /></a><br /> <br /> <div style="margin: 5px 20px 20px;"> <div class="smallfont"> Quote:</div> <table border="0" cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" width="99%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="alt2" style="border: 1px inset;">  Originally Posted by <strong>peterpanpixiedust</strong> <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href="/forum/post/1285299"><img alt="View Post" border="0" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" /></a> <div style="font-style: italic;"> June 18th at Dreams Cancun! Wow, we all are so close to eachother! I have gone dress shopping. I ordered my dress and my TTD. They told me 8 months for my dress, and I ordered it in February. Tooo long! My TTD is from Gianinar (knock off) and that is only supposed to take 30-45 days, but we are on day 50 now... haha!<br /> Here's my dress (Sottero &amp; Midgely). I&quot;m having a corset added<br /> <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href="http://i37.photobucket.com/albums/e79/peterpanpixiedust/DSC05041.jpg"><img alt="Click the image to open in full size." border="0" class="tcattdimgresizer" src="http://i37.photobucket.com/albums/e79/peterpanpixiedust/DSC05041.jpg" /></a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href="http://i37.photobucket.com/albums/e79/peterpanpixiedust/DSC05039.jpg"><img alt="Click the image to open in full size." border="0" class="tcattdimgresizer" src="http://i37.photobucket.com/albums/e79/peterpanpixiedust/DSC05039.jpg" /></a><br /> <br /> here is inspiration for TTD knockoff<br /> <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href="http://www.amymichelson.com/popup_diamond.html">amy michelson : Diamond</a><br /> <br /> Everyone else please show off your finds (be it dress, favors, invites, anything... I'm so unsure of what to do yet)</div> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> Love your dress, so pretty! I have no good finds yet...I have 3 of my besties getting married this summer so I have been super busy helping them!</blockquote> <br /> <br />
