array (
  'pid' => '1382070',
  'post' => '<p> <br /> <br /> &nbsp;</p> <blockquote class="ipsBlockquote">Originally Posted by <strong>alhanay24</strong>&nbsp;<a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/thread/33008/grand-riviera-princess-grand-sunset-princess/140#post_1174524"><img alt="View Post" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" style="border-bottom: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-right: 0px solid" /></a><br /> <br /> <div style="margin: 5px 20px 20px"> <div class="smallfont" style="margin-bottom: 2px"> Quote:</div> <table border="0" cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" width="99%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="alt2" style="border-bottom: 1px inset; border-left: 1px inset; border-top: 1px inset; border-right: 1px inset">  Originally Posted by <strong>Pelican10</strong> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/post/1173632"><img alt="View Post" border="0" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" /></a> <div style="font-style: italic"> Ok thanks. THe Thai Beach Club does look nice from what I have seen.<br /> <br /> I haven\'t heard back from the resort yet. Just trying to weigh out options because we aren\'t doing the private beach reception and Im not sure about the a la carte option because its only an hour and a half <img alt="" border="0" class="inlineimg" src="http://files.bestdestinationwedding.com/images/smilies/sad.gif" title="Sad" /> Anyone else heard of the Thai Beach Club?</div> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> Hi, I am getting married April 7th and I will have about 30 guests. We are doing what is called a gala dinner and it only costs $37/person. It is in a private room with the DJ included, however, it does not come with a bar. Let me know if you would like more information, I have all the brochures with me.</blockquote> <p> hiii ladies.. im planning our wedding at the GRP as well, and im wanting to do the gala dinner as well. I like having it be a private reception. Its too bad about booze not bring included :(&nbsp; How many hours do you get the gala dinner for? With the DJ are you giving him some of your own music to play as well?&nbsp; I would love it if you could email me the brochures that you..that would be great!!&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="mailto:danisha229@hotmail.com">danisha229@hotmail.com</a><br /> <br /> &nbsp;</p>',
)
