 are you giving him some of your own music to play as well?&nbsp; I would love it if you could email me the brochures that you..that would be great!!&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href="mailto:danisha229@hotmail.com">danisha229@hotmail.com</a><br /> <br /> &nbsp;</p>
