array (
  'pid' => '1385163',
  'post' => '<p> <br /> I was just about to spend $245 on 25 customer Mishka\'s Maracas...they are so beautiful. But I think my fiance has about had it with all my extra spending!! good tip and I will bring down a silver marker to personalize!&nbsp; $25 sounds much better.<br /> &nbsp;</p> <blockquote class="ipsBlockquote">Originally Posted by <strong>astreit</strong>&nbsp;<a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/thread/55498/maracas#post_1186080"><img alt="View Post" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" style="border-right: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-bottom: 0px solid" /></a><br /> <br /> <div style="margin: 5px 20px 20px"> <div class="smallfont" style="margin-bottom: 2px"> Quote:</div> <table border="0" cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" width="99%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="alt2" style="border-right: 1px inset; border-top: 1px inset; border-left: 1px inset; border-bottom: 1px inset">  Originally Posted by <strong>CristiandJamie</strong> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/post/1185211"><img alt="View Post" border="0" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" /></a> <div style="font-style: italic"> I read somewhere on the forum that you can find a TON of maracas on 5th in Playa Del Carmen. There are a lot of shops on the strip and should have maracas there. If I find the thread I will post it. I think the person said they were around a $1 each...</div> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> Thank you so much! I didn\'t know what we could find easily down there.</blockquote> <br /> <br />',
)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
