array (
  'pid' => '1411791',
  'post' => '<p> <br /> Really creative stuff. Thanks for the ideas. I will start ordering mine soon. LOVED the Honey Do List!</p> <blockquote class="ipsBlockquote">Originally Posted by <strong>RunningBride24</strong>&nbsp;<a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/thread/39413/everything-you-can-do-with-vistaprint/220#post_1311176"><img alt="View Post" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" style="border-bottom: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-right: 0px solid" /></a><br /> <br /> <div style="margin: 5px 20px 20px"> <div class="smallfont" style="margin-bottom: 2px"> Quote:</div> <table border="0" cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" width="99%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="alt2" style="border-bottom: 1px inset; border-left: 1px inset; border-top: 1px inset; border-right: 1px inset">  Originally Posted by <strong>bahiabride2010</strong> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/post/1295668"><img alt="View Post" border="0" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" /></a> <div style="font-style: italic"> So here are some pics of the goodies from VISTA that we are putting in our OOT bags. I\'m so excited...I had a DIY day with my bridesmaids and we got all our OOT bags packed and assembled...we are delivering them to our guests before we leave for Punta Cana!<br /> <br /> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="http://i977.photobucket.com/albums/ae254/bahiabride/Wedding%20Planning/DSC01372.jpg"><img alt="Click the image to open in full size." border="0" class="tcattdimgresizer" src="http://i977.photobucket.com/albums/ae254/bahiabride/Wedding%20Planning/DSC01372.jpg" /></a> - 10 free<br /> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="http://i977.photobucket.com/albums/ae254/bahiabride/Wedding%20Planning/DSC01384.jpg"><img alt="Click the image to open in full size." border="0" class="tcattdimgresizer" src="http://i977.photobucket.com/albums/ae254/bahiabride/Wedding%20Planning/DSC01384.jpg" /></a><br /> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="http://i977.photobucket.com/albums/ae254/bahiabride/Wedding%20Planning/DSC01383.jpg"><img alt="Click the image to open in full size." border="0" class="tcattdimgresizer" src="http://i977.photobucket.com/albums/ae254/bahiabride/Wedding%20Planning/DSC01383.jpg" /></a> - Letters for OOT bags - 50 Oversized Postcards Free<br /> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="http://i977.photobucket.com/albums/ae254/bahiabride/DSC01382.jpg"><img alt="Click the image to open in full size." border="0" class="tcattdimgresizer" src="http://i977.photobucket.com/albums/ae254/bahiabride/DSC01382.jpg" /></a> - Wedding Journal for Mike and I to write in throughout our wedding week<br /> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="http://i977.photobucket.com/albums/ae254/bahiabride/Wedding%20Planning/DSC01385-1.jpg"><img alt="Click the image to open in full size." border="0" class="tcattdimgresizer" src="http://i977.photobucket.com/albums/ae254/bahiabride/Wedding%20Planning/DSC01385-1.jpg" /></a> - 1 free Funny Notepad for my FI - I also made him a Game Over Journal, T-Shirt and Sticky Notes! :)<br /> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="http://i977.photobucket.com/albums/ae254/bahiabride/Wedding%20Planning/DSC01386.jpg"><img alt="Click the image to open in full size." border="0" class="tcattdimgresizer" src="http://i977.photobucket.com/albums/ae254/bahiabride/Wedding%20Planning/DSC01386.jpg" /></a> - Notepads for our guests...I customized them for each couple or single guest</div> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> <br /> LOVE IT! So creative! Nice work!</blockquote> <br /> <br /> <p> &nbsp;</p>',
)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
