array (
  'pid' => '1414016',
  'post' => '<p> <br /> Thank you so much. very helpful!<br /> &nbsp;</p> <blockquote class="ipsBlockquote">Originally Posted by <strong>amberdgraham</strong>&nbsp;<a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/thread/31173/pre-wedding-brochure#post_582746"><img alt="View Post" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" style="border-bottom: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-right: 0px solid" /></a><br /> <br /> <div style="margin: 5px 20px 20px"> <div class="smallfont" style="margin-bottom: 2px"> Quote:</div> <table border="0" cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" width="99%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="alt2" style="border-bottom: 1px inset; border-left: 1px inset; border-top: 1px inset; border-right: 1px inset">  Originally Posted by <strong>LadyCheese</strong> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/post/582117"><img alt="View Post" border="0" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" /></a> <div style="font-style: italic"> yeah, theres actually 56 I just havent updated my siggy...its crazy, I didnt expect that many people!!<br /> <br /> someone has to have a DR based brochure, LOL.</div> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> I found the one that I put in my invitation packets at <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="http://dr1.com/travel/puntacana/">Punta Cana - Dominican Republic</a> They also have a lot of travel info etc on the website that you could put into Word documents or something.<br /> <br /> If you can\'t download off their website anymore I\'m happy to send the version I have to (I edited out some of the ads and stuff to just leave in the articles.) It\'s a pdf file around 30 pages!<br /> <br /> I also have a DR Fact Sheet that has info about traveling in, etc etc that I\'m happy to share. <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="mailto:amberdgraham@yahoo.com">amberdgraham@yahoo.com</a></blockquote> <br /> <br /> <p> &nbsp;</p>',
)
