array (
  'pid' => '1441445',
  'post' => '<p> love the idea of the "individuals and in a final place represent both of us together"<br /> &nbsp;</p> <blockquote class="ipsBlockquote">Originally Posted by <strong>CristiandJamie</strong>&nbsp;<a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/thread/22650/post-pics-of-your-wedding-cake/230#post_1175331"><img alt="View Post" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" style="border: 0px solid;" /></a><br /> <br /> <div style="margin: 5px 20px 20px;"> <div class="smallfont" style="margin-bottom: 2px;"> Quote:</div> <table border="0" cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" width="99%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="alt2" style="border: 1px inset;">  Originally Posted by <strong>kuteliya</strong> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/post/1167450"><img alt="View Post" border="0" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" /></a> <div style="font-style: italic;"> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="http://i165.photobucket.com/albums/u71/kuteliya/Wedding%20Pictures%20by%20People/Cake.jpg"><img alt="Click the image to open in full size." border="0" class="tcattdimgresizer" src="http://i165.photobucket.com/albums/u71/kuteliya/Wedding%20Pictures%20by%20People/Cake.jpg" /></a><br /> <br /> This was our cake. We wanted a cake that had some meaning to it. So we chose to have each layer represent each of us as individuals and in a final place represent both of us together(which was @ the beach were we went on our first date and where we got married). Each of the layers also had their own flavor which I loved since it gave me an excuse to eat more cake! hahaha!</div> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> I love your cake and it\'s very unique!</blockquote> <br /> <br /> <p> &nbsp;</p>',
)
