array (
  'pid' => '1471898',
  'post' => '<p> <br /> thanks!!!</p> <blockquote class="ipsBlockquote">Originally Posted by <strong>~Debra~</strong>&nbsp;<a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/thread/29441/jamaica-decorators-florist#post_678821"><img alt="View Post" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" style="border: 0px solid;" /></a><br /> <br /> <div style="margin:20px; margin-top:5px; "> <div class="smallfont" style="margin-bottom:2px"> Quote:</div> <table border="0" cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" width="99%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="alt2" style="border:1px inset">  Originally Posted by <strong>bo__1</strong> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/post/678316"><img alt="View Post" border="0" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" /></a> <div style="font-style:italic"> what is the email address for floral fantasies - i don\'t see one in their contact us info<br /> <br /> thanx!!</div> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> If you go to \'Contact Us\' on their website it will take you to another page. At the top of that page look where it says \'Email: Floral Fantasies\' Click on \'Floral Fantasies and it will take you to a page where you just fill in your information and then they will email you back.</blockquote> <br /> <br /> <p> &nbsp;</p>',
)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
> Time: 1395962206 / Thu, 27 Mar 2014 23:16:46 +0000
> URL: /admin/index.php?adsess=845f6c850772369311b67ecf8645904c&app=forums&module=forums&section=fix&st=158250
> <p> <br /> thanks!!!</p> <blockquote class="ipsBlockquote">Originally Posted by <strong>~Debra~</strong>&nbsp;<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href="/forum/thread/29441/jamaica-decorators-florist#post_678821"><img alt="View Post" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" style="border: 0px solid;" /></a><br /> <br /> <div style="margin:20px; margin-top:5px; "> <div class="smallfont"> Quote:</div> <table border="0" cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" width="99%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="alt2" style="border:1px inset">  Originally Posted by <strong>bo__1</strong> <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href="/forum/post/678316"><img alt="View Post" border="0" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" /></a> <div style="font-style:italic"> what is the email address for floral fantasies - i don't see one in their contact us info<br /> <br /> thanx!!</div> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> If you go to 'Contact Us' on their website it will take you to another page. At the top of that page look where it says 'Email: Floral Fantasies' Click on 'Floral Fantasies and it will take you to a page where you just fill in your information and then they will email you back.</blockquote> <br /> <br /> <p> &nbsp;</p>
