array (
  'pid' => '1479012',
  'post' => '<p> your guests will really appreciate your hard work!!!! great job!!!<br /> &nbsp;</p> <blockquote class="ipsBlockquote">Originally Posted by <strong>JanineA</strong>&nbsp;<a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/thread/58495/my-diy-extravaganza#post_1276786"><img alt="View Post" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" style="border: 0px solid;" /></a><br /> <br /> <div style="margin:20px; margin-top:5px; "> <div class="smallfont" style="margin-bottom:2px"> Quote:</div> <table border="0" cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" width="99%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="alt2" style="border:1px inset">  Originally Posted by <strong>LynnieS</strong> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/post/1276513"><img alt="View Post" border="0" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" /></a> <div style="font-style:italic"> Ok, I had a whole day of just DIY projects and had so much fun doing it. Some of this stuff was already done but thought I\'d post it anyways. I have less than two weeks til we leave and Im soooo excited. Planning thread to come very soon!<br /> <br /> Here is our guest "book" and sign. Guests will sign the markerboard and snap a photo.<br /> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="http://i763.photobucket.com/albums/xx274/lschwab1/wedding/wedding024.jpg"><img alt="Click the image to open in full size." border="0" class="tcattdimgresizer" src="http://i763.photobucket.com/albums/xx274/lschwab1/wedding/wedding024.jpg" /></a><br /> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="http://i763.photobucket.com/albums/xx274/lschwab1/wedding/wedding034.jpg"><img alt="Click the image to open in full size." border="0" class="tcattdimgresizer" src="http://i763.photobucket.com/albums/xx274/lschwab1/wedding/wedding034.jpg" /></a><br /> <br /> Our wedding programs<br /> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="http://i763.photobucket.com/albums/xx274/lschwab1/wedding/wedding036.jpg"><img alt="Click the image to open in full size." border="0" class="tcattdimgresizer" src="http://i763.photobucket.com/albums/xx274/lschwab1/wedding/wedding036.jpg" /></a><br /> <br /> <br /> The place cards/ "shake this for a kiss" cards to be tied to our maracas made by Mishka. Can\'t wait to see them!<br /> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="http://i763.photobucket.com/albums/xx274/lschwab1/wedding/wedding059.jpg"><img alt="Click the image to open in full size." border="0" class="tcattdimgresizer" src="http://i763.photobucket.com/albums/xx274/lschwab1/wedding/wedding059.jpg" /></a><br /> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="http://i763.photobucket.com/albums/xx274/lschwab1/wedding/wedding060.jpg"><img alt="Click the image to open in full size." border="0" class="tcattdimgresizer" src="http://i763.photobucket.com/albums/xx274/lschwab1/wedding/wedding060.jpg" /></a><br /> <br /> My Welcome Letters. each personalized to each guest couple. On the second page is the itinerary. We will set these in each room withour maracas. We have 50 guests so OOT bags were out of the question for our budget<br /> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="http://i763.photobucket.com/albums/xx274/lschwab1/wedding068.jpg"><img alt="Click the image to open in full size." border="0" class="tcattdimgresizer" src="http://i763.photobucket.com/albums/xx274/lschwab1/wedding068.jpg" /></a><br /> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="http://i763.photobucket.com/albums/xx274/lschwab1/wedding069.jpg"><img alt="Click the image to open in full size." border="0" class="tcattdimgresizer" src="http://i763.photobucket.com/albums/xx274/lschwab1/wedding069.jpg" /></a><br /> <br /> My DIY BM tanks. Thanks to Erica!! These were so easy and fun. Only cost me $8/shirt.<br /> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="http://i763.photobucket.com/albums/xx274/lschwab1/wedding/wedding046.jpg"><img alt="Click the image to open in full size." border="0" class="tcattdimgresizer" src="http://i763.photobucket.com/albums/xx274/lschwab1/wedding/wedding046.jpg" /></a><br /> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="http://i763.photobucket.com/albums/xx274/lschwab1/wedding/wedding052.jpg"><img alt="Click the image to open in full size." border="0" class="tcattdimgresizer" src="http://i763.photobucket.com/albums/xx274/lschwab1/wedding/wedding052.jpg" /></a><br /> <br /> more to come!!</div> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> I love the tanks can you share how you did them. I would love to do one for each of my BM and then one for me of course.</blockquote> <br /> <br /> <p> &nbsp;</p>',
)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
> Time: 1395962206 / Thu, 27 Mar 2014 23:16:46 +0000
> URL: /admin/index.php?adsess=845f6c850772369311b67ecf8645904c&app=forums&module=forums&section=fix&st=158250
> <p> your guests will really appreciate your hard work!!!! great job!!!<br /> &nbsp;</p> <blockquote class="ipsBlockquote">Originally Posted by <strong>JanineA</strong>&nbsp;<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href="/forum/thread/58495/my-diy-extravaganza#post_1276786"><img alt="View Post" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" style="border: 0px solid;" /></a><br /> <br /> <div style="margin:20px; margin-top:5px; "> <div class="smallfont"> Quote:</div> <table border="0" cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" width="99%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="alt2" style="border:1px inset">  Originally Posted by <strong>LynnieS</strong> <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href="/forum/post/1276513"><img alt="View Post" border="0" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" /></a> <div style="font-style:italic"> Ok, I had a whole day of just DIY projects and had so much fun doing it. Some of this stuff was already done but thought I'd post it anyways. I have less than two weeks til we leave and Im soooo excited. Planning thread to come very soon!<br /> <br /> Here is our guest "book" and sign. Guests will sign the markerboard and snap a photo.<br /> <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href="http://i763.photobucket.com/albums/xx274/lschwab1/wedding/wedding024.jpg"><img alt="Click the image to open in full size." border="0" class="tcattdimgresizer" src="http://i763.photobucket.com/albums/xx274/lschwab1/wedding/wedding024.jpg" /></a><br /> <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href="http://i763.photobucket.com/albums/xx274/lschwab1/wedding/wedding034.jpg"><img alt="Click the image to open in full size." border="0" class="tcattdimgresizer" src="http://i763.photobucket.com/albums/xx274/lschwab1/wedding/wedding034.jpg" /></a><br /> <br /> Our wedding programs<br /> <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href="http://i763.photobucket.com/albums/xx274/lschwab1/wedding/wedding036.jpg"><img alt="Click the image to open in full size." border="0" class="tcattdimgresizer" src="http://i763.photobucket.com/albums/xx274/lschwab1/wedding/wedding036.jpg" /></a><br /> <br /> <br /> The place cards/ "shake this for a kiss" cards to be tied to our maracas made by Mishka. Can't wait to see them!<br /> <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href="http://i763.photobucket.com/albums/xx274/lschwab1/wedding/wedding059.jpg"><img alt="Click the image to open in full size." border="0" class="tcattdimgresizer" src="http://i763.photobucket.com/albums/xx274/lschwab1/wedding/wedding059.jpg" /></a><br /> <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href="http://i763.photobucket.com/albums/xx274/lschwab1/wedding/wedding060.jpg"><img alt="Click the image to open in full size." border="0" class="tcattdimgresizer" src="http://i763.photobucket.com/albums/xx274/lschwab1/wedding/wedding060.jpg" /></a><br /> <br /> My Welcome Letters. each personalized to each guest couple. On the second page is the itinerary. We will set these in each room withour maracas. We have 50 guests so OOT bags were out of the question for our budget<br /> <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href="http://i763.photobucket.com/albums/xx274/lschwab1/wedding068.jpg"><img alt="Click the image to open in full size." border="0" class="tcattdimgresizer" src="http://i763.photobucket.com/albums/xx274/lschwab1/wedding068.jpg" /></a><br /> <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href="http://i763.photobucket.com/albums/xx274/lschwab1/wedding069.jpg"><img alt="Click the image to open in full size." border="0" class="tcattdimgresizer" src="http://i763.photobucket.com/albums/xx274/lschwab1/wedding069.jpg" /></a><br /> <br /> My DIY BM tanks. Thanks to Erica!! These were so easy and fun. Only cost me $8/shirt.<br /> <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href="http://i763.photobucket.com/albums/xx274/lschwab1/wedding/wedding046.jpg"><img alt="Click the image to open in full size." border="0" class="tcattdimgresizer" src="http://i763.photobucket.com/albums/xx274/lschwab1/wedding/wedding046.jpg" /></a><br /> <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href="http://i763.photobucket.com/albums/xx274/lschwab1/wedding/wedding052.jpg"><img alt="Click the image to open in full size." border="0" class="tcattdimgresizer" src="http://i763.photobucket.com/albums/xx274/lschwab1/wedding/wedding052.jpg" /></a><br /> <br /> more to come!!</div> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> I love the tanks can you share how you did them. I would love to do one for each of my BM and then one for me of course.</blockquote> <br /> <br /> <p> &nbsp;</p>
