array (
  'pid' => '1506271',
  'post' => '<p> <br /> That looks like it is so much fun!!!!</p> <blockquote class="ipsBlockquote">Originally Posted by <strong>Heidi</strong>&nbsp;<a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/thread/10896/cute-rsvp-wording/10#post_204400"><img alt="View Post" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" style="border: 0px solid;" /></a><br /> <br /> <div style="margin:20px; margin-top:5px; "> <div class="smallfont" style="margin-bottom:2px"> Quote:</div> <table border="0" cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" width="99%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="alt2" style="border:1px inset">  Originally Posted by <strong>nenamono</strong> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/post/191750"><img alt="View Post" border="0" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" /></a> <div style="font-style:italic"> OH this sounds like so much fun. Can you share how you worded them or left your blanks <img alt="" border="0" class="inlineimg" src="http://files.bestdestinationwedding.com/images/smilies/smile72.gif" title="Smile72" /></div> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> ooh, sorry I didn\'t see this before. Here is what we sent them:<br /> <br /> <font color="Red"> _________! (exclamation) _____________________(name(s)) ________(will/will not) attend the wedding and _______ (will/will not) attend the welcome dinner on Thursday night. We can\'t wait to ________________(verb) and ______________(verb) in Jamaica! Don\'t forget to _____________________________ (advice) and _____________________!(advice)<br /> <br /> Wedding Dinner:<br /> <br /> _____ Meat isn\'t my thing. Please include a veggie meal for me<br /> <br /> _____ If I eat ____________, I will die horribly from anaphylactic shock. Please include an allergy-free meal for me.</font><br /> <br /> The only downside is, only 20% of our invitees sent them back by the deadline... they might have been a little difficult for some people. My sister in particular tells me she feels so much pressure to be funny &amp; witty on them so she hasn\'t sent hers yet.</blockquote> <br /> <br /> <p> &nbsp;</p>',
)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
> Time: 1395962206 / Thu, 27 Mar 2014 23:16:46 +0000
> URL: /admin/index.php?adsess=845f6c850772369311b67ecf8645904c&app=forums&module=forums&section=fix&st=158250
> <p> <br /> That looks like it is so much fun!!!!</p> <blockquote class="ipsBlockquote">Originally Posted by <strong>Heidi</strong>&nbsp;<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href="/forum/thread/10896/cute-rsvp-wording/10#post_204400"><img alt="View Post" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" style="border: 0px solid;" /></a><br /> <br /> <div style="margin:20px; margin-top:5px; "> <div class="smallfont"> Quote:</div> <table border="0" cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" width="99%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="alt2" style="border:1px inset">  Originally Posted by <strong>nenamono</strong> <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href="/forum/post/191750"><img alt="View Post" border="0" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" /></a> <div style="font-style:italic"> OH this sounds like so much fun. Can you share how you worded them or left your blanks <img alt="" border="0" class="inlineimg" src="http://files.bestdestinationwedding.com/images/smilies/smile72.gif" title="Smile72" /></div> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> ooh, sorry I didn't see this before. Here is what we sent them:<br /> <br /> <font color="Red"> _________! (exclamation) _____________________(name(s)) ________(will/will not) attend the wedding and _______ (will/will not) attend the welcome dinner on Thursday night. We can't wait to ________________(verb) and ______________(verb) in Jamaica! Don't forget to _____________________________ (advice) and _____________________!(advice)<br /> <br /> Wedding Dinner:<br /> <br /> _____ Meat isn't my thing. Please include a veggie meal for me<br /> <br /> _____ If I eat ____________, I will die horribly from anaphylactic shock. Please include an allergy-free meal for me.</font><br /> <br /> The only downside is, only 20% of our invitees sent them back by the deadline... they might have been a little difficult for some people. My sister in particular tells me she feels so much pressure to be funny &amp; witty on them so she hasn't sent hers yet.</blockquote> <br /> <br /> <p> &nbsp;</p>
