array (
  'pid' => '1595691',
  'post' => '<br /> <br /> <blockquote class="ipsBlockquote">Originally Posted by <strong>orionandmari072510</strong>&nbsp;<a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/t/6221/customs-in-mexico-declaring-wedding-stuff/50#post_1302002"><img alt="View Post" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" /></a><br /> <br /> <div style="margin:20px; margin-top:5px; "> <div class="smallfont" style="margin-bottom:2px"> Quote:</div> <table border="0" cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" width="99%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="alt2" style="border:1px inset">  Originally Posted by <strong>gkashmira</strong> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/post/152756"><img alt="View Post" border="0" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" /></a> <div style="font-style:italic"> We walked right through but we did have my friend bring through one of the bags. Honestly we didnt\' have that much stuff and since both of us were carrying a dress/suit I think it was obvious that it was our wedding...</div> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> do they have problems with bringing wedding dresses? how did that part go?</blockquote> <p> &nbsp;</p> <p> I THINK that the 300 limit is per person and it\'s not for personal items for your use.&nbsp; So your wedding dress should be fine. I\'ve taken plenty of personal items that were worth more than that.<br /> <br /> &nbsp;</p> <p> &nbsp;</p>',
)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
> Time: 1395962207 / Thu, 27 Mar 2014 23:16:47 +0000
> URL: /admin/index.php?adsess=845f6c850772369311b67ecf8645904c&app=forums&module=forums&section=fix&st=158250
> <br /> <br /> <blockquote class="ipsBlockquote">Originally Posted by <strong>orionandmari072510</strong>&nbsp;<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href="/t/6221/customs-in-mexico-declaring-wedding-stuff/50#post_1302002"><img alt="View Post" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" /></a><br /> <br /> <div style="margin:20px; margin-top:5px; "> <div class="smallfont"> Quote:</div> <table border="0" cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" width="99%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="alt2" style="border:1px inset">  Originally Posted by <strong>gkashmira</strong> <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href="/forum/post/152756"><img alt="View Post" border="0" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" /></a> <div style="font-style:italic"> We walked right through but we did have my friend bring through one of the bags. Honestly we didnt' have that much stuff and since both of us were carrying a dress/suit I think it was obvious that it was our wedding...</div> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> do they have problems with bringing wedding dresses? how did that part go?</blockquote> <p> &nbsp;</p> <p> I THINK that the 300 limit is per person and it's not for personal items for your use.&nbsp; So your wedding dress should be fine. I've taken plenty of personal items that were worth more than that.<br /> <br /> &nbsp;</p> <p> &nbsp;</p>
