array (
  'pid' => '1598554',
  'post' => '<p> <br /> I Love this half up and half down hair style.&nbsp; I think this would work for a beach wedding.<br /> &nbsp;</p> <blockquote class="ipsBlockquote">Originally Posted by <strong>JulieG</strong>&nbsp;<a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/t/7503/show-me-your-wedding-hair-style#post_120645"><img alt="View Post" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" /></a><br /> <br /> <div style="margin: 5px 20px 20px"> <div class="smallfont" style="margin-bottom: 2px"> Quote:</div> <table border="0" cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" width="99%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="alt2" style="border-bottom: 1px inset; border-left: 1px inset; border-top: 1px inset; border-right: 1px inset">  Originally Posted by <strong>Heidi</strong> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/post/120642"><img alt="View Post" border="0" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" /></a> <div style="font-style: italic"> I like these (all contingent upon me growing my hair long enough by April! haha!) - <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="http://i20.photobucket.com/albums/b207/be_byte6/Hair%20-%20Updos/HAIR-updo7783.jpg"><img alt="Click the image to open in full size." border="0" class="tcattdimgresizer" src="http://i20.photobucket.com/albums/b207/be_byte6/Hair%20-%20Updos/HAIR-updo7783.jpg" /></a><br /> <br /> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="http://i20.photobucket.com/albums/b207/be_byte6/Hair%20-%20Softly%20Pulled%20Back/HAIR-softlypulledback7017.jpg"><img alt="Click the image to open in full size." border="0" class="tcattdimgresizer" src="http://i20.photobucket.com/albums/b207/be_byte6/Hair%20-%20Softly%20Pulled%20Back/HAIR-softlypulledback7017.jpg" /></a><br /> <br /> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="http://i20.photobucket.com/albums/b207/be_byte6/Hair%20-%20Softly%20Pulled%20Back/hair101.jpg"><img alt="Click the image to open in full size." border="0" class="tcattdimgresizer" src="http://i20.photobucket.com/albums/b207/be_byte6/Hair%20-%20Softly%20Pulled%20Back/hair101.jpg" /></a></div> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> I love the Nicole Kidman one, I think you could do that with your hair lenght, it does not need to be long.</blockquote> <br /> <br /> <p> &nbsp;</p>',
)
