array (
  'pid' => '1632532',
  'post' => '<blockquote class="ipsBlockquote">Originally Posted by <strong>mkdela</strong>&nbsp;<a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/t/8188/expecting-more-than-70-guests/10#post_145394"><img alt="View Post" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" /></a><br /> <br /> <div style="margin: 5px 20px 20px"> <div class="smallfont" style="margin-bottom: 2px"> Quote:</div> <table border="0" cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" width="99%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="alt2" style="border-bottom: 1px inset; border-left: 1px inset; border-top: 1px inset; border-right: 1px inset">  Originally Posted by <strong>melglnh2o</strong> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/post/143843"><img alt="View Post" border="0" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" /></a> <div style="font-style: italic"> TMarraty and mkdela,<br /> <br /> Thanks for the suggestions. Do either of you have photos of how and where the reception would be set up?<br /> <br /> Thanks,<br /> Melissa</div> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> Hi Melissa - unfortunately I don\'t have any photos yet of the set up. The reception is going to be under a large palapa near the pool, it is covered but will still be open-air which we thought was the best of both worlds.<br /> If I get some pictures I will definitely pass them on!</blockquote> <p> Hi Mkdela,</p> <p> I am thinking about having my reception at the gran melia cancun for about 120 people. How did you reception there turn out?? Do you have any pictures? Any advise would be appreciated! Thanks!</p> <p> Jess</p>',
)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
> Time: 1395962207 / Thu, 27 Mar 2014 23:16:47 +0000
> URL: /admin/index.php?adsess=845f6c850772369311b67ecf8645904c&app=forums&module=forums&section=fix&st=158250
> <blockquote class="ipsBlockquote">Originally Posted by <strong>mkdela</strong>&nbsp;<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href="/t/8188/expecting-more-than-70-guests/10#post_145394"><img alt="View Post" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" /></a><br /> <br /> <div style="margin: 5px 20px 20px"> <div class="smallfont"> Quote:</div> <table border="0" cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" width="99%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="alt2" style="border-bottom: 1px inset; border-left: 1px inset; border-top: 1px inset; border-right: 1px inset">  Originally Posted by <strong>melglnh2o</strong> <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href="/forum/post/143843"><img alt="View Post" border="0" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" /></a> <div style="font-style: italic"> TMarraty and mkdela,<br /> <br /> Thanks for the suggestions. Do either of you have photos of how and where the reception would be set up?<br /> <br /> Thanks,<br /> Melissa</div> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> Hi Melissa - unfortunately I don't have any photos yet of the set up. The reception is going to be under a large palapa near the pool, it is covered but will still be open-air which we thought was the best of both worlds.<br /> If I get some pictures I will definitely pass them on!</blockquote> <p> Hi Mkdela,</p> <p> I am thinking about having my reception at the gran melia cancun for about 120 people. How did you reception there turn out?? Do you have any pictures? Any advise would be appreciated! Thanks!</p> <p> Jess</p>
