array (
  'pid' => '1745117',
  'post' => '<blockquote class="ipsBlockquote">Originally Posted by <strong>Heidi</strong>&nbsp;<a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/t/933/budget/60#post_69108"><img alt="View Post" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" /></a><br /> <br /> <div style="margin: 5px 20px 20px;"> <div class="smallfont" style="margin-bottom: 2px;"> Quote:</div> <table border="0" cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" width="99%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="alt2" style="border: 1px inset currentColor;">  Originally Posted by <strong>Debs</strong> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/post/44013"><img alt="View Post" border="0" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" /></a> <div style="font-style: italic;"> Holy moly, we made our decision on time and date and we haven\'t even talked budget yet with FI, but I think I better sit down PDQ and figure this stuff out!!<br /> <br /> I was thinking $8K tops but most of your budgets blow this out of the water <img alt="" border="0" class="inlineimg" src="http://files.bestdestinationwedding.com/images/smilies/eek.gif" title="EEK!" /><br /> <br /> Looks like I got some figuring out to do <img alt="" border="0" class="inlineimg" src="http://files.bestdestinationwedding.com/images/smilies/dizzy.gif" title="Dizzy" /><br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> One Question though, do you couples have the cash for this stuff? Or is this going mostly on credit? My FI and I have <i>some</i> debt, but certainly don\'t have any savings to speak of that we can pay for this thing cash. It\'s stressing me a bit <img alt="" border="0" class="inlineimg" src="http://files.bestdestinationwedding.com/images/smilies/confused.gif" title="Confused" /></div> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> you\'re not alone with the $8k budget tops... we\'re trying to stay around $6,000ish.<br /> <br /> my budget so far (assuming 40 guests, which may end up being way too high!):<br /> <br /> Royal Wedding Package: $995.00<br /> Boutonnieres (2): $12.00<br /> Bouquets (2): $60.00<br /> Steel Band 1 hr: $250.00<br /> DJ 2 hrs: $300.00<br /> Open Bar: $400.00<br /> Hall/Disco Rental 2 hrs: $250.00<br /> Room - 6 nights (approx): $1,776.00<br /> Flight (approx): $800.00<br /> STD\'s: $16.40<br /> Invitations: $150.00<br /> Dress: $250.00<br /> Veil: $40.00<br /> Photographer: ?<br /> TOTAL $5,299.40<br /> <br /> (as of now we\'re paying for it all. If parents can kick in for anything, we\'ll probably upgrade some things)</blockquote> <p> I know this is very old but I was wondering where you got married? I am seeing all of you lovely ladies highligghting budgets under 10 grand, this is amazing! Would love to know what areas you\'ve found this is. I am looking for our wedding in mexico, 2014, for around 50 guests.</p>',
)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
> Time: 1395962207 / Thu, 27 Mar 2014 23:16:47 +0000
> URL: /admin/index.php?adsess=845f6c850772369311b67ecf8645904c&app=forums&module=forums&section=fix&st=158250
> <blockquote class="ipsBlockquote">Originally Posted by <strong>Heidi</strong>&nbsp;<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href="/t/933/budget/60#post_69108"><img alt="View Post" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" /></a><br /> <br /> <div style="margin: 5px 20px 20px;"> <div class="smallfont"> Quote:</div> <table border="0" cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" width="99%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="alt2" style="border: 1px inset currentColor;">  Originally Posted by <strong>Debs</strong> <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href="/forum/post/44013"><img alt="View Post" border="0" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" /></a> <div style="font-style: italic;"> Holy moly, we made our decision on time and date and we haven't even talked budget yet with FI, but I think I better sit down PDQ and figure this stuff out!!<br /> <br /> I was thinking $8K tops but most of your budgets blow this out of the water <img alt="" border="0" class="inlineimg" src="http://files.bestdestinationwedding.com/images/smilies/eek.gif" title="EEK!" /><br /> <br /> Looks like I got some figuring out to do <img alt="" border="0" class="inlineimg" src="http://files.bestdestinationwedding.com/images/smilies/dizzy.gif" title="Dizzy" /><br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> One Question though, do you couples have the cash for this stuff? Or is this going mostly on credit? My FI and I have <i>some</i> debt, but certainly don't have any savings to speak of that we can pay for this thing cash. It's stressing me a bit <img alt="" border="0" class="inlineimg" src="http://files.bestdestinationwedding.com/images/smilies/confused.gif" title="Confused" /></div> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> you're not alone with the $8k budget tops... we're trying to stay around $6,000ish.<br /> <br /> my budget so far (assuming 40 guests, which may end up being way too high!):<br /> <br /> Royal Wedding Package: $995.00<br /> Boutonnieres (2): $12.00<br /> Bouquets (2): $60.00<br /> Steel Band 1 hr: $250.00<br /> DJ 2 hrs: $300.00<br /> Open Bar: $400.00<br /> Hall/Disco Rental 2 hrs: $250.00<br /> Room - 6 nights (approx): $1,776.00<br /> Flight (approx): $800.00<br /> STD's: $16.40<br /> Invitations: $150.00<br /> Dress: $250.00<br /> Veil: $40.00<br /> Photographer: ?<br /> TOTAL $5,299.40<br /> <br /> (as of now we're paying for it all. If parents can kick in for anything, we'll probably upgrade some things)</blockquote> <p> I know this is very old but I was wondering where you got married? I am seeing all of you lovely ladies highligghting budgets under 10 grand, this is amazing! Would love to know what areas you've found this is. I am looking for our wedding in mexico, 2014, for around 50 guests.</p>
