eel Band 1 hr: $250.00<br /> DJ 2 hrs: $300.00<br /> Open Bar: $400.00<br /> Hall/Disco Rental 2 hrs: $250.00<br /> Room - 6 nights (approx): $1,776.00<br /> Flight (approx): $800.00<br /> STD\'s: $16.40<br /> Invitations: $150.00<br /> Dress: $250.00<br /> Veil: $40.00<br /> Photographer: ?<br /> TOTAL $5,299.40<br /> <br /> (as of now we\'re paying for it all. If parents can kick in for anything, we\'ll probably upgrade some things)</blockquote> <p> I know this is very old but I was wondering where you got married? I am seeing all of you lovely ladies highligghting budgets under 10 grand, this is amazing! Would love to know what areas you\'ve found this is. I am looking for our wedding in mexico, 2014, for around 50 guests.</p>',
