array (
  'pid' => '1761361',
  'post' => '<blockquote class="ipsBlockquote">Originally Posted by <strong>Martha</strong>&nbsp;<a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/t/16488/question-about-the-other-kind-of-o/30#post_1142068"><img alt="View Post" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" /></a><br /> <br /> <div style="margin:20px; margin-top:5px; "> <div class="smallfont" style="margin-bottom:2px"> Quote:</div> <table border="0" cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" width="99%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="alt2" style="border:1px inset">  Originally Posted by <strong>DreaW</strong> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/post/283983"><img alt="View Post" border="0" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" /></a> <div style="font-style:italic"> My dang wife is making me write....</div> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> WTF? I sure am glad Drea isn\'t here anymore. I don\'t want sex advice from Erik or any other person that isn\'t officially a part of this board! And, I certainly don\'t want them knowing my business...</blockquote> <p> &nbsp;</p> <blockquote class="ipsBlockquote">Originally Posted by <strong>*Rachel*</strong>&nbsp;<a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/t/16488/question-about-the-other-kind-of-o/40#post_1162626"><img alt="View Post" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" /></a><br /> <br /> <div style="margin:20px; margin-top:5px; "> <div class="smallfont" style="margin-bottom:2px"> Quote:</div> <table border="0" cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" width="99%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="alt2" style="border:1px inset">  Originally Posted by <strong>katrina</strong> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/post/1153640"><img alt="View Post" border="0" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" /></a> <div style="font-style:italic"> ok, what a creeper</div> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> LMAO. I think it\'s always charming when a guy tells women about their own bodies and how they work.</blockquote> <p> &nbsp;</p> <p> Yeah, that was awkward! &nbsp;Remember when posted to tell off jean marcus for posting in a thread about sex? &nbsp;It was like he was doing the exact same thing, only erik was posting in the PF. &nbsp;</p> <p> &nbsp;</p> <blockquote class="ipsBlockquote">Originally Posted by <strong>tvt</strong>&nbsp;<a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/t/16488/question-about-the-other-kind-of-o/40#post_1173745"><img alt="View Post" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" /></a><br /> <br /> revival of an oldie!<br /> <br /> so this may sound crazy, but i recently had one my my best Os in my sleep. so what kind of O is that?</blockquote> <p> &nbsp;</p> <p> I\'ve been having those a lot lately. &nbsp;They started when I went off the pill. &nbsp;I was talking to a friend about it and now she\'s heading up a genetics of orgasms study. &nbsp;I was on orgasm restriction after IVF and I woke up to one that then hurt for an hour after. &nbsp;So weird! &nbsp;And it was really common, too on TTC forums as an early pregnancy sign. &nbsp;</p> <p> &nbsp;</p> <p> <span style="line-height: 1.231;">We might be the odd balls, but TTC has spiced up our sex life. &nbsp;And now that I\'m paying attention to my cycle, I can definitely tell sex is better around ovulation. &nbsp;</span></p>',
)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
> Time: 1395962207 / Thu, 27 Mar 2014 23:16:47 +0000
> URL: /admin/index.php?adsess=845f6c850772369311b67ecf8645904c&app=forums&module=forums&section=fix&st=158250
> <blockquote class="ipsBlockquote">Originally Posted by <strong>Martha</strong>&nbsp;<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href="/t/16488/question-about-the-other-kind-of-o/30#post_1142068"><img alt="View Post" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" /></a><br /> <br /> <div style="margin:20px; margin-top:5px; "> <div class="smallfont"> Quote:</div> <table border="0" cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" width="99%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="alt2" style="border:1px inset">  Originally Posted by <strong>DreaW</strong> <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href="/forum/post/283983"><img alt="View Post" border="0" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" /></a> <div style="font-style:italic"> My dang wife is making me write....</div> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> WTF? I sure am glad Drea isn't here anymore. I don't want sex advice from Erik or any other person that isn't officially a part of this board! And, I certainly don't want them knowing my business...</blockquote> <p> &nbsp;</p> <blockquote class="ipsBlockquote">Originally Posted by <strong>*Rachel*</strong>&nbsp;<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href="/t/16488/question-about-the-other-kind-of-o/40#post_1162626"><img alt="View Post" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" /></a><br /> <br /> <div style="margin:20px; margin-top:5px; "> <div class="smallfont"> Quote:</div> <table border="0" cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" width="99%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="alt2" style="border:1px inset">  Originally Posted by <strong>katrina</strong> <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href="/forum/post/1153640"><img alt="View Post" border="0" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" /></a> <div style="font-style:italic"> ok, what a creeper</div> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> LMAO. I think it's always charming when a guy tells women about their own bodies and how they work.</blockquote> <p> &nbsp;</p> <p> Yeah, that was awkward! &nbsp;Remember when posted to tell off jean marcus for posting in a thread about sex? &nbsp;It was like he was doing the exact same thing, only erik was posting in the PF. &nbsp;</p> <p> &nbsp;</p> <blockquote class="ipsBlockquote">Originally Posted by <strong>tvt</strong>&nbsp;<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href="/t/16488/question-about-the-other-kind-of-o/40#post_1173745"><img alt="View Post" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" /></a><br /> <br /> revival of an oldie!<br /> <br /> so this may sound crazy, but i recently had one my my best Os in my sleep. so what kind of O is that?</blockquote> <p> &nbsp;</p> <p> I've been having those a lot lately. &nbsp;They started when I went off the pill. &nbsp;I was talking to a friend about it and now she's heading up a genetics of orgasms study. &nbsp;I was on orgasm restriction after IVF and I woke up to one that then hurt for an hour after. &nbsp;So weird! &nbsp;And it was really common, too on TTC forums as an early pregnancy sign. &nbsp;</p> <p> &nbsp;</p> <p> <span style="line-height: 1.231;">We might be the odd balls, but TTC has spiced up our sex life. &nbsp;And now that I'm paying attention to my cycle, I can definitely tell sex is better around ovulation. &nbsp;</span></p>
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
