array (
  'pid' => '1769098',
  'post' => '<blockquote class="ipsBlockquote">Originally Posted by <strong>JUSTUSTWO</strong>&nbsp;<a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/t/27406/diy-jamaica-favors#post_511037"><img alt="View Post" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" /></a><br /> <br /> <div style="margin:20px; margin-top:5px; "> <div class="smallfont" style="margin-bottom:2px"> Quote:</div> <table border="0" cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" width="99%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="alt2" style="border:1px inset">  Originally Posted by <strong>msasfraz</strong> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="/forum/post/508021"><img alt="View Post" border="0" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" /></a> <div style="font-style:italic"> i was going for the beach in the bottle favors...here is what ive made so far.... did anyone bring the glass bottles and do beach in the bottle themed favors... just afraid that 20 bottles will get heavy.. maybe plastic bottles would be better? thoughts please....<br /> <br /> <a data-ipb=\'nomediaparse\' href="http://i344.photobucket.com/albums/p335/msasfraz/weddingpics1015.jpg"><img alt="Click the image to open in full size." border="0" class="tcattdimgresizer" src="http://i344.photobucket.com/albums/p335/msasfraz/weddingpics1015.jpg" /></a></div> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> These are really cute! Good job with them.</blockquote> <p> i think I am going to try these</p>',
)
