array (
  'pid' => '1769162',
  'post' => '[quote name="TAHOEJENI" url="/t/49704/would-you-rather-game#post_1000714"]<div style="margin:20px;margin-top:5px;"> <div class="smallfont" style="margin-bottom:2px;">Quote:</div> [TABLE] [TR] <td class="alt2" style="border:1px inset;"> Originally Posted by [B]marryinghimagain[/B] [URL=/forum/post/999585]<img alt="View Post" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" style="border:0px solid;"> [/URL] [I]I would rather work at a low paying job that I love. Nothing worse than having to get up and go to a job you hate and have to spend all day there. If you HAD to make a choice during a catastrophic event, would you save your husband? or would you save your child?[/I] </td> [/TR] [/TABLE] </div> I can see why no one has answered. lol What kind of question is this? (Just kidding) Hmm *if* I had a kid, I think I would save the kid. Gosh, this is so hard. Okay, my turn. Would you rather have no nose or no ears?[/quote] No nose. Would you rather be rich or famous?',
)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
> Time: 1395962207 / Thu, 27 Mar 2014 23:16:47 +0000
> URL: /admin/index.php?adsess=845f6c850772369311b67ecf8645904c&app=forums&module=forums&section=fix&st=158250
> [quote name="TAHOEJENI" url="/t/49704/would-you-rather-game#post_1000714"]<div style="margin:20px;margin-top:5px;"> <div class="smallfont">Quote:</div> [TABLE] [TR] <td class="alt2" style="border:1px inset;"> Originally Posted by [B]marryinghimagain[/B] [URL=/forum/post/999585]<img alt="View Post" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" style="border:0px solid;"> [/URL] [I]I would rather work at a low paying job that I love. Nothing worse than having to get up and go to a job you hate and have to spend all day there. If you HAD to make a choice during a catastrophic event, would you save your husband? or would you save your child?[/I] </td> [/TR] [/TABLE] </div> I can see why no one has answered. lol What kind of question is this? (Just kidding) Hmm *if* I had a kid, I think I would save the kid. Gosh, this is so hard. Okay, my turn. Would you rather have no nose or no ears?[/quote] No nose. Would you rather be rich or famous?
