> [quote name="Jaime" url="/t/18853/any-xcaret-park-prices-weddings-contact#post_369144"]I just got info from Julieta at the eco-park she replied within 2 days from my email request. I will post the info she gave me as long as I can figure out how to do it :) Note that there will be a 10% increase in 2009 approx. Hope this helps those of you interested. I plan to visit the ecopark next week and will post an update when I return. <div style="margin:20px;margin-top:5px;"> <div class="smallfont">Quote:</div> [TABLE] [TR] <td class="alt2" style="border:1px inset;"> Originally Posted by [B]nde062010[/B] [URL=/forum/post/333243]<img alt="View Post" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" style="border:0px solid;"> [/URL] [I]Has anyone ever gotten a hold of the WC at the Xcaret Eco-Park for info or prices? It sounds like a couple women tried and never made contact so it was taken off their list. I would love to have my wedding there, but have no idea how crazy the prices are? Any help is appreciated! <img alt="" class="inlineimg" src="http://files.bestdestinationwedding.com/images/smilies/smile03.gif" style="border:0px solid;" title="Smile03"> [/I] </td> [/TR] [/TABLE] </div> [ATTACHMENT=4873]Banquet.doc (55.5k. doc file)[/ATTACHMENT] [ATTACHMENT=4874]Dos Playas Restaurant.doc (43k. doc file)[/ATTACHMENT] [ATTACHMENT=4875]La Isla Restaurant Kit.doc (42k. doc file)[/ATTACHMENT] [ATTACHMENT=4876]Open Bar.doc (44.5k. doc file)[/ATTACHMENT][/quote] Hi Jaime, Can you email me these files? Just joined and I can't open attachments. Thank you!
