array (
  'pid' => '1800825',
  'post' => 'Lo[quote name="gkashmira" url="/t/85/show-us-your-wedding-dress#post_16329"]<div style="margin:20px;margin-top:5px;"> <div class="smallfont" style="margin-bottom:2px;">Quote:</div> [TABLE] [TR] <td class="alt2" style="border:1px inset;"> Originally Posted by [B]HBBRIDE[/B] [URL=/forum/post/16321]<img alt="View Post" class="inlineimg" src="/img/forum/go_quote.gif" style="border:0px solid;"> [/URL] [I]Kashmira, I clicked on the link but was unsuccessful. I would like to see the dress.... My dress was way more than I ever thougt I would pay. It is actually being made to fit me and it hasn\'t been started yet. I was waiting until after the holidays...hoping to loose a few pounds...yeah right!!! It is hard when you fall in love with a dress becasue you will compare it to every other dress you try on![/I] </td> [/TR] [/TABLE] </div> Kristi - Try this link: [URL=http://www.moniquelhuillier.com/webcollection/bridal/runway/2005fa/05.html]Monique Lhuillier - fall 2005[/URL] [URL=http://i197.photobucket.com/albums/aa240/carlymcmullen/BDW%20Photos%20for%20Others/weddingdress-kash.jpg]<img alt="Click the image to open in full size." class="tcattdimgresizer" src="http://i197.photobucket.com/albums/aa240/carlymcmullen/BDW%20Photos%20for%20Others/weddingdress-kash.jpg" style="border:0px solid;"> [/URL] For some reason none of the websites are allowing me to save the picture to my desktop...[/quote] love this dress',
)
